<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NEH" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Nehemia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nehemia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nehemia</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nehemia</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow Nehemia chekhai, now arui khin dow 430 BC khe chekhai. Mami bowih kowi kowh arui uowi mih dow Babulawn pren kowi cham takhang mih Israeluüa Jerusalem kowi uang pan mih lawnguan chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nehemia bowih dow tali bak mowr nowngia bak chekhai. (1) Jerusalem marow kowi Nehemia uang plan mih lawnguan. Aia kowi dow Persia pren mang mih Juda pren nakruitown kowkow nakowi kowchinah khai. (2) Jerusalem marow naplan raw kown mih lawnguan, (3) Thurai kowh ari aiang bowih Ezra phat pe mih lawnguan hai prenchakuüa taphuang angak mih ün lawnguan. (4) Judauüa kowh kruitown mih Nehemia kowh lup uowi küng tak mih lawnguan chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih kowi kowh lang pankri mih lawnguan dow Thurai luk kowi anikma Nehemia neplawng nesak mih hai plan plan Thurai tut-e aia awr lü awr leng mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Siphai aluchow: Siphai aluchow pami dow tasen miuüa thumchak kowi kowh chang alow mih siphai kowi kowh tekah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Leba: Leba pami dow tasen miuüa kowh rutchün khawkleng chekhai. Nami dow kau hai lawngha hown kowh thawpah mih chekhai. Nami leba kowi dow auüi müa aluk hownia dak kowi chawp pe leng lowk khai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Jerusalem kowi Nehemia uang plan mih 1:1-2:20</para>
  <para style="io1">Plan raw Jerusalem tap mih 3:1-7:73</para>
  <para style="io1">Thurai ari aiang phat hai tatow sangbowk laitawm mih 8:1-10:39</para>
  <para style="io1">Nehemia kowh akeng mih lup uowi mih 11:1-13:31</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NEH 1" />
  <para style="s">Nehemia chup Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 1:1" />Ang dow Hakalia chapa Nehemia chekhai. Mami bowih kowi kowh arui uowi mih dow ang kowh lup lawnguan chekhai. Persia pren kowi mang Artazerzes chowm mang mih pirmi ning kowi kowh Kislev la khe ang uowi mih dow Susa marow kri kowi chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 1:2" />Nakhowk khe ang tainau Hanani mih ang tut-e uang khai, now aia hown Juda pren hownia kowh uang plan miuüa paw uang tawi khai. Amatni kowi dow Babulawn pren kowi <char style="w">takhangra</char> hownia kowplan miuüa lawnguan hai Jerusalem marow lawnguan ang hawt lüntaah khai.<verse eid="NEH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 1:3" />Nami khin khe amatni tek ang mih, “Babulawn pren kowi takhangra hownia Juda pren kowi uang plan miuüa dow nowm nowm krat büah khai, now ka rukrai büah khai. Jerusalem marow tap ün dow takhue khai, now tapplawt ün paw kam khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 1:4" />Naiawngün laiklow tata hanow ang <char style="w">khang hawm</char> khai, now chowm se pre sum ni mowr kar hai nguk hown ang uowi khai. Now mukuang Thurai tut-e ang awr lü awr leng khai. <verse eid="NEH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 1:5" />Ang awr chup Thurai mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG mukuang Thurai, en dow kri kraingma hai kramra uowima mih Thurai chekhai. Sakrau en miuüa hai en kowh ana pek chün miuüa kowi dow en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura laikham en town pe reng chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 1:6" />En nar Israeluüa vüi ni-ni uar-uar ang awr lü mih sakrauma hown iu sünta ang diah, now pela ang ching diah. Kingküala en mih angak anging Israeluüa changta mih srui dow ang uang taphuang khowk. Ang hai apa krungchakuüa paw changta angak khai nowm. <verse eid="NEH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 1:7" />Lainowmma suiiai kaniai mih lup anging changta khai. En nar Mosi kowi kowh en peah mih ana pek maten, rirow maten hai ari aiang maten anging chün dowi chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 1:8" />“Sakrauma hai en nar Mosi kowi kowh en peah mih ana tuakah diah. En tek pe mih, ‘Ang kaah sakowm dowi iawng che enni uowi khai hanow akeng chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi ang nauetta enni plawt kown. <verse eid="NEH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 1:9" />Nachenganchepaw ang tut-e che enni uang plan khai, now ang kowh ana pek che enni chün khai hanow prenchur nammowt kowi enni cham taset plawt chepaw ang nakrawi kua enni hanow ang kowh uowi rah pahai ang lang kloah mih arah kowi ang nauang pawla enni kown,’ pape khai.<verse eid="NEH 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 1:10" />“Anging dow en kowh nar hai en kowh maru chowtaih. Anging kowi dow en kowh kri kraingma mih nowng changra hai akürma mih rut hown en uang klanla anging mih chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 1:11" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, sakrauma hai en kowh nar ang awr lü mih iu sünta ang diah. Now ringkaw en mih kowi anging awmrawm chekhai. Naiawng rakowi en kowh naruüa awr lü mih paw iu sünta pe diah. Ang awr lüah mih iawng iu chang ang diah, now saksing sanala ang kown mih saktuak mang kowi iu peah diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:11">Ang dow mang kowh grep tui pek mih chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NEH 2" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow kowi Nehemia kowplan mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 2:1" />Persia pren kowi Artazerzes chowm mang mih pirmi ning kowi kowh Nisan la khe mang kowi ang peah grep tui khai. Nami dowi rawn khe mawnchuruma katpaw mang pur kowi ang kowkowi dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 2:2" />Naiawng rakowi mang lünta ang mih, “Arau uowi dowi e en mawnchuru lai kowbow? En tuak krat mih nowm lownow,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:2">Nami laiklow tata hanow nowm nowm ang kram khai. <verse eid="NEH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 2:3" />Nachenganchepaw ang tek pe mang mih, “Mangkri dow chowngdawng sakklangma pauowi reng lah! Tawngplawng kowchow ang kowh saktuak nakrat dowi kown? Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh pipu-uüa tadupra marow dow tapiak khai bowt, now tapplawt ün paw towkta bowk khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 2:4" />Nakhowk khe mang lünta ang mih, “Tawng chow ang nachang en kown?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:4">Naiawng rakowi mukuang Thurai tut-e ang awr lü khai. <verse eid="NEH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 2:5" />Nami kung kowi ang tek pe mang mih, “Mangkri che sak-ih ang hai saksing sana ang khai hanow Juda pren kowi kowh ang kowh pipu-uüa tadupra marow kowi pe mang ang diah. Nami marow kowplan thawp iawk kown ang nau,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 2:6" />Nakhowk khe mang ria kowi dow masiuüa mang paw tawi chowm phülü khai. Now mang lünta ang mih, “Mün ni chow en cham takra kown? Now tawng khe chow en nauang plan kown?” pakhai. Mün ni chow cham takra kown mih khin ang tek pe hanow mangkri dow pe mang ang khai.<verse eid="NEH 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 2:7" />Now ang plan tek pe mang mih, “Mangkri, Iufratis aw pang kowi kowh pren iawng Juda pren kowi kowmang kown ang nau. Naiawng rakowi en che sak-ih ang khai hanow nami pren iawng ang naia mangla kownkow nami pren kowi kowh kruitown miuüa kowi krawi sak pe cha diah. <verse eid="NEH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 2:8" />Nami klen kowi mang kowh kaurawng chawng mih Asaf kowi paw sakla pe cha aram diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kimplawt klowng thawp müa, marow tap thawp müa hai ang uowi rah kim thawp müa vüi kowi pacham pe ang singh lah,” pakhai. Ang kowh Thurai saksing sana ang rakowi ang lüah iawng mangkri dow chang ang khai.<verse eid="NEH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 2:9" />Nahanow mangkri dow siphai aluchow pre sum ia hai kawrnga kowi kowh chowm mih siphai hawmh kowi krawi chin ang pathum khai. Akung kowi Iufratis aw paipra pown kowi kowh kruitown miuüa tut-e kowting hanow amatni kowi dow mangkri kowh chasak ang peah khai. <verse eid="NEH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 2:10" />Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa kowi uang khowngah kownkow maru uang lowk ia pe pami satang dow Sanbalat hai Tobia iüah mih ta khai. Naiawng rakowi amatchi dow lainowmma kunmarau khai. Sanbalat dow Horon chenchap chekhai, now Tobia dow Amawn chenchap chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nehemia kowmü Jerusalem marow tap mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="NEH 2:11-12" />Jerusalem marow kowi ang kowting hanow ang kowuowi sum ni khai. Now sum ni kung kowi dow iak-e khe mih ang pawla maru sangrum hanow nami marow hownia ang cham lawt khai. Nakhowk khe ang chowmah mih kawrngaramchük klen kowi dow tawng iawng mih tawncher paw ang pawla dowi chekhai. Tawkche Jerusalem marow vüi nachang kownkow CHAKRAMANG pe ang saktuak mih dow amia kowi paw ang cham phuang dowi chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 2:11-12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 2:13" />Nami iak dow Lawngrawi Tapplawt iawng panow Ruamang Tuikuam hai Mawngchawng Tapplawt prakowi ang kowkowi khai. Now Jerusalem marow tap piaknama mih hai kamnama mih tapplawt ün achima ang kowmüla khai. <verse eid="NEH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 2:14" />Nami kung kowi dow Tuikuam Tapplawt hai Mang Kowh Kanh prakowi ang kowkowi khai. Tawkche huaklu kraing lai rakowi ang kowh kawrngaramchük dow nami tiama iawng tawi ia mang dowi chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 2:15" />Naiawng rakowi nami iak dow Jerusalem marow tap piak mih krawi müla se Kidrawn Lawngrawi iawng ang kowkowi khai. Now Lawngrawi Tapplawt iawng panow marow kowi ang uang plan khai. <verse eid="NEH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 2:16" />Tawng kowi chow ang cham kowi mih hai tawng chow ang cham chang mih marow kowi kowh maru iukuüa tuk dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang nau changah mih lawnguan dow mia iawng mih Juda aluchowuüa kowi paw ang tek pe dowi chekhai; uamowuüa kowi lah, ringkaw uowima mih maru-uüa kowi lah, marow kowi kowh maru iukuüa kowi lah tawngpaw amatni kowi ang tek pe dowi tak chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 2:17" />Nachenganchepaw akung kowi dow naiawngün aluchowuüa kowi ang tek pe mih, “A-i kowh akrat pusara dow enni khi khowk. Jerusalem marow dow piaknama, now tapplawt ün paw kamnama chekhai. Naiawng rakowi chu, Jerusalem marow tap a-i plan thawp iawk diah sik. Nahanow maru mih nachangla a-i rensi küakau kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="NEH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 2:18" />Nami kung kowi dow Thurai saksing sana ang mih lawnguan hai mangkri krawi tek ang mih lawnguan amatni kowi ang tek pe khai. Nakhowk khe amatni tek mih, “Chu, a-i uown tarowng bowt lah,” pakhai. Naiawng hai amatni dow lup iung chang uown tarowng khai bowt.<verse eid="NEH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 2:19" />Nachenganchepaw nami laiklow tata hanow Sanbalat hai Tobia iüah dow khare anging khai. Amatchi tek anging mih, “Tawng chow enni chang? Enni kingküa mangkri kown mih bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 2:20" />Nakhowk khe amatchi kowi ang klangah mih, “Anging kowh lup chang nachawnla kownkow mukuang Thurai iu tawi khowng anging kown taih. Aia kowh naruüa anging dow Jerusalem marow tap naplan thawp iawk kown. Nachenganchepaw Jerusalem marow lawnguan kowi dow enni kowh tawng iawng mih kakbak hai alow uowi dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NEH 3" />
  <para style="s">Krawi plan thawp Jerusalem marow tap miuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 3:1" />Mami dow Jerusalem marow tap hai tapplawt krawi plan thawp miuüa ming chekhai: Uamow lang kri mih Eliasib hai aia dak kowi kowh uamowuüa dow Ruapur Tapplawt pami krawi thawp khai. Now nami tapplawt dow Thurai tut-e ap-ah büah hanow thawp pe abüng büah khai. Nami kung kowi dow nami tapplawt hownia Akawm Ia Siphai Kimkrowng hai Hananel Kimkrowng mowr krawi thawp tap büah hanow Thurai tut-e ap-ah büah khai.<verse eid="NEH 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 3:2" />Amatni ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Jeriko marowchakuüa chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:2">Now amatni ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Imri kowh chapa Zakur chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 3:3" />Now Dam Tapplawt thawp miuüa dow Hasena kowh chapauüa chekhai. Amatni dow tapplawt büng, abüng klia müa lawng hai alawng sowr müa kli thawpla pe khai. <verse eid="NEH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 3:4" />Amatni ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Uria kowh chapa Meremawt chekhai. Uria dow Hakawz kowh chapa chekhai. Now amatni ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Berekia kowh chapa Mesulam chekhai. Berekia dow Mesezabel kowh chapa chekhai. Amatni ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Bana kowh chapa Zadawk chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 3:5" />Amatni ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Tekoa marowchakuüa chekhai. Nachenganchepaw nami marow kowi kowh aluchowuüa dow lup chang miuüa kowi kowh aluchowuüa krüa kowi nachang lup kown mih tawi nau dowi chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 3:6" />Now Jesana Tapplawt krawi thawp mih dow Pasea kowh chapa Joiada hai Besodeia kowh chapa Mesulam iüah chekhai. Amatchi dow tapplawt büng, abüng klia müa lawng hai alawng sowr müa kli thawpla pe khai. <verse eid="NEH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 3:7" />Amatni ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Gibeawn chenchap Melatia, Meronawt chenchap Jadawn, Gibeawn marowchakuüa hai Mizpa marowchakuüa chekhai. Mizpa marow dow Iufratis aw satkup pra kowh pren kruitown mih kowh marow chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 3:8" />Amatni ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Harhaia kowh chapa Uziel chekhai. Uziel dow kuh hown kowh uanh thawp sara chekhai. Amatni ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Hanani chekhai. Hanani dow paingbawng thawp sara chekhai. Naiawng hai amatni dow Jerusalem marow tap mih aphiama mih tap mowr alai kowh iawng krawi thawpah khai. <verse eid="NEH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 3:9" />Amatni ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Hur kowh chapa Refaia chekhai. Refaia dow Jerusalem marow dawnglang mowr kowi kowh kruitown mih chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 3:10" />Amatni ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Harumap kowh chapa Jedaia chekhai. Nami aia krawi thawpah mih tap dow aia kim hown atawnchow chekhai. Amatni ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Hasabneia kowh chapa Hatus chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 3:11" />Amatni ria kowi kowh tap hai maih changra kimkrowng krawi thawp mih dow Harim kowh chapa Malkija hai Pahat-Moab kowh chapa Hasub iüah chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 3:12" />Amatni ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Halohes kowh chapa Salum hai Salum kowh chamauüa chekhai. Salum dow akeng pra kowh Jerusalem marow dawnglang mowr kruitown mih chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 3:13" />Now Lawngrawi Tapplawt krawi thawp mih dow Hanun hai Zanoa marowchakuüa chekhai. Amatni dow tapplawt büng, abüng klia müa lawng hai alawng sowr müa kli thawpla pe khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:13">Nami klen kowi amatni dow Lawngrawi Tapplawt hownia Mawngchawng Tapplawt mowr 1,000 muk mih tap paw krawi plan thawpla khai.<verse eid="NEH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 3:14" />Mawngchawng Tapplawt krawi thawp mih dow Rekab kowh chapa Malkija chekhai. Aia dow Bet-Hakerem süng kowi kowh kruitown mih chekhai. Aia dow tapplawt büng, abüng klia müa lawng hai alawng sowr müa kli thawpla pe khai.<verse eid="NEH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 3:15" />Now Tuikuam Tapplawt krawi thawp mih dow Kawlhoze kowh chapa Salun chekhai. Aia dow Mizpa süng kowi kowh kruitown mih chekhai. Aia dow tapplawt büng, abüng klia müa lawng hai alawng sowr müa kli thawpla pe khai, now nami tapplawt kowi aluk paw aia thawpla pe khai. Aia dow mang kowh bakan ria kowi kowh Silo Kanh tap hownia uownah hanow David marow hownia kowh dawngbowk mowr krawi thawp khai. <verse eid="NEH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 3:16" />Nami klen kowi kowh ta lat mih tap krawi thawp mih dow Azbuk kowh chapa Nehemia chekhai. Nehemia dow Bet-Zur süng dawnglang mowr kruitown mih chekhai. Aia krawi thawp tap mih dow David krungchak kowh tadupra ria hownia thaiah mih kanh hai tasen kiakma mih siphaiuüa kim mowr chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Krawi plan thawp tap mih Leviuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 3:17" />Leviuüa paw krawi plan thawp khai. Naiawngün Leviuüa dow Bani kowh chapa Rehum nimkrüa kowi kowh lup chang miuüa chekhai. Aia ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Hasabia chekhai. Aia dow Keila powngah mih pren dawnglang mowr kruitown mih chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 3:18" />Aia ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Henadad kowh chapa Binui chekhai. Binui dow alowk mih pra kowh Keila pren powng dawnglang mowr kruitown mih chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 3:19" />Aia ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Jesua kowh chapa Ezer chekhai. Ezer dow Mizpa pren kruitown mih chekhai. Aia krawi thawp tap mih dow tasen müa rutchün khawkleng towk rah kim pra kowh pünla mih tiama pur hownia takui mih tap nui mowr chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 3:20" />Aia ria kowi dow Zabai kowh chapa Baruk mih süngürma hown tap nui hownia uamow lang kri mih Eliasib kowh kimplawt mowr krawi thawp khai. <verse eid="NEH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 3:21" />Aia ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Uria kowh chapa Meremawt chekhai. Aia dow Eliasib kowh kimplawt hownia Eliasib kowh kim chur mowr krawi thawp tap khai. Uria dow Hakawz kowh chapa chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Krawi plan thawp tap mih uamowuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 3:22" />Meremawt ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Jerusalem riaret kowi kowh uowi mih uamowuüa chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 3:23" />Amatni ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Benjamin hai Hasub iüah chekhai. Amatchi krawi thawpah mih tap dow amatchi kim re-e kowh tap chekhai. Amatchi ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Maseia kowh chapa Azaria chekhai. Aia krawi thawpah mih tap dow aia kim re-e kowh chekhai. Maseia dow Anania kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 3:24" />Aia ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Henadad kowh chapa Binui chekhai. Aia krawi thawp tap mih dow Azaria kowh kim hownia tap takui ditchow mih nui mowr chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 3:24" /><verse number="25-26" style="v" sid="NEH 3:25-26" />Now tap takui mih nui hownia krawi thawp mih dow Uzai kowh chapa Palal chekhai. Nami tap nui dow kangchawng miuüa viadawng re-e kowh mang kim hownia Aluk Kimkrowng pur prakowi chekhai. Aia ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Paraws kowh chapa Pedaia hai Thurai chup kim kowi chang lup mih Ofel hungh kowi kowh uowi miuüa chekhai. Amatni krawi thawpah mih dow satlawt pra kowh Tui Tapplawt hai kimkrowng mowr chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 3:25-26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akeng miuüa krawi plan thawp tap mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 3:27" />Nami ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Tekoa marowchakuüa chekhai. Amatni dow nami dowi rawn khe rik thawp tap parah khowk chekhai. Amatni krawi thawpah mih dow kimkrowng hownia Ofel hungh re-e kowh tap mowr chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 3:28" />Now pathum mih uamowuüa dow Kawrnga Tapplawt luk kowi kowh tap krawi thawp khai. Amatni krawi thawpah mih tap dow amatni chowlowkkow kim ria kowi kowh tap chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 3:29" />Nami ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Imer kowh chapa Zadawk chekhai. Nami dow aia kim pur pra kowh tap chekhai. Nami ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Satlawt Tapplawt kowi kowh kangchawng mih Sekania kowh chapa Semaia chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 3:30" />Nami ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Selemia kowh chapa Hanani hai Zalaf kowh taruk lawmbawr mih chapa Hanun iüah chekhai. Amatchi dow nami dowi rawn khe paw thawp tap parah khowk chekhai. Nami ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow Berekia kowh chapa Mesulam chekhai. Nami dow aia kim purdowng kowi kowh tap chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 3:31" />Nami ria kowi kowh tap krawi thawp mih dow kuh hown kowh uanh thawp sara Malkija chekhai. Aia krawi thawpah mih dow Takuara Tapplawt pur kowi kowh Thurai chup kim kowi chang lup miuüa hai kun chang miuüa kim mowr chekhai, now tap nui luk kowi kowh kim mowr chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 3:32" />Achur kowi kowh krawi thawp mih dow kuh hown kowh uanh thawp sarauüa hai kun chang miuüa chekhai. Amatni krawi thawp tap mih dow tap nui luk kowi kowh kim hownia Ruapur Tapplawt mowr chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 3:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NEH 4" />
  <para style="s">Plan thawp tap khe Judauüa kowi ransu-uüa pusaah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 4:1" />Anging plan thawp tap mih satang tata hanow Samari marow kowi kowh kruitown mih Sanbalat dow mapaw sak-ih dowi hai lainowmma kunmarau khai. Aia dow Judauüa kowi khareah khai. <verse eid="NEH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 4:2" />Aia dow aia re-e kowh maru kawmuüa hai Samari marow kowi kowh siphaiuüa pur kowi tek mih, “Naiawngün kür uowi dowi mih Judauüa matawng chow chang? Nami lup nowng chang büah kown pe bow? Chang phuchua büah now pani sang nami tap nowng thawp kown mih ka tuak büah bow? Adi asekma hai akamnama khowk mih hua chun hownia pawah mih hua hown akhawtma nowng thawp tap büah kown pe bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 4:3" />Nakhowk khe Amawn chenchap Tobia dow aia ria kowi tawi uowi khai. Tobia paw tawi tek mih, “Kowbüah thawpah mih tap luk kowi brenkhui khowm padow kowphüt now tap napiak kown mih chowlowbow,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 4:4" />Nakhowk khe Nehemia chup Thurai mih, “Aw anging kowh Thurai, tawng iawng chow maru nü anging klowk anging dowi mih sünta diah. Amatni tekah mih laiklow iawng amatni luk kowi pe tingah diah. Amatni kowi dow tasenra hownia ransu-uüa khümla mih maru iawng akeng pren kowi cham uowi pat changah diah. <verse eid="NEH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 4:5" />Amatni kowh aprek dow hangkow lawtta pe diah, now amatni kowh angak dow en pur hownia hangkow mata pe diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow tap thawp miuüa pur kowi pe en rukrai khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 4:6" />Akung kowi nami tap dow anging nau thawpah mowr mih kowi dawnglang khowk anging nowng thawpta. Tawngplawng kowchow panow tap thawp miuüa mih süngür sakkraima hown thawpah büah mih chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 4:7" />Nachenganchepaw Sanbalat, Tobia, Arabuüa, Amawnuüa hai Asdawd marowchakuüa dow thawp Jerusalem marow tap mih hai tap takhue mih pitta khowk mih ta hanow lainowmma kunmarau khai. <verse eid="NEH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 4:8" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow takrüpah bowk hanow Jerusalem marow kowi nauang sen kownkow hai nauang pusa kownkow sangkrang khai. <verse eid="NEH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 4:9" />Nachenganchepaw anging chup Thurai khai, now ni-ni uar-uar kangchawng mih anging towah khai.<verse eid="NEH 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 4:10" />Nami khin khe Judauüa tawi chawk lai mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 4:10">“Lup chang miuüa kür iaw khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 4:10">Hua di hua sek paw lainowmma hu khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 4:10">Naiawng rakowi a-i kangowchow nowng thawp tap dowi bowt tham,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 4:11" />Naiawng phaw mih khin khe ransu-uüa tatek mih, “Kowbüah tuk dowi hai khi dowi rawn khe kowbüah tut-e a-i kowkowi hanow kowbüah kowi a-i nasaita bowk kown, now kowbüah kowh lup dow a-i nataingta pe kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="NEH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 4:12" />Naiawng rakowi ransu-uüa riaret kowi uowi mih Judauüa dow aplan aplan uang tek anging mih, “Enni mih anging tut-e uang plan büa diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="NEH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 4:13" />Naiawngün laiklow ang tata hanow chowlowkkow krungchak uowi iawng ang paw maru hanow saidawng, reh hai leba ang peah khai, now naiawngün maru-uüa kowi mih tap lak pra kowh anemchow mih arah kowi tap takhue rah re-e ang towah khai. <verse eid="NEH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 4:14" />Nakhowk khe naiawngün maru-uüa tuak krat mih ang tukta khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni hai amatni kowh aluchowuüa hown amatni kowh maru iukuüa kowi ang tek pe mih, “Ransu-uüa kowi hangkow kram. Lang kri lang kraing mih hai kramra uowima mih CHAKRAMANG kowi ka tuakah büa diah, now enni kowh tainau-uüa, chauüa, masi hai kim vüi tasen büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 4:15" />Now amatni kowh sangkrangra laiklow anging tuk mih hai amatni sangkrang iawng Thurai pe phawah dowi mih anging kowh ransu-uüa tukta khai bowt. Nami kung kowi dow tap prakowi anging kowplan hanow chowlowkkow lup bak uowi iawng anging kowchang lup khai iawk.<verse eid="NEH 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16-17" style="v" sid="NEH 4:16-17" />Nami ni hownia bowt now anging kowh maru-uüa mih maru iun dawnglang mowr chang lup khai, now akeng miuüa dow reh, kawngma, leba hai leba sek dowkma hown tasen kown mih kamrütma uowi khai. Thawp tap mih Judauüa kung kowi tawi iowngah hanow amatni kowh aluchowuüa mih tawi kruitownah khai. Now tap thawp müa uanh tawn miuüa khowm padow dowkla tasen müa rutchün khawkleng papra se chang lup khai. <verse eid="NEH 4:16-17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 4:18" />Thawp tap mih maten paw amatni kelang kowi tanla saidawng bowk chekhai, now tasen kown khe kowh tum baw kown mih maru dow ang re-e tawi uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 4:19" />Akung kowi dow ringkaw uowi mih maru-uüa, maru iukuüa hai akeng miuüa kowi ang tek pe mih, “A-i kowh lup changra aiukma chekhai. Naiawng rakowi tap riaria lowkkowlowk hownia alak alakchow a-i uowi khai. <verse eid="NEH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 4:20" />Nachenganchepaw enni ta baw tün mih khin khe dow baw tün rah re-e uang takua talawm büa diah. A-i vüi kowi a-i kowh Thurai mih nadowk tasen kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 4:21" />Naiawng hai uar thowi hownia uariiu pat maru iun dawnglang mih reh dowkma uowi khai, now anging dow chang lup khai. <verse eid="NEH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 4:22" />Nami khin khe maru kawmuüa kowi ang tek pe mih, “Uar-e dow chowlowkkow nar hown kachakuüa maten Jerusalem marow lak kowi pacham uowi lah. Nahanow uar-e dow amatni mih ka chawng marow kown towbowt, now ni-e dow amatni ia chang lup kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 4:23" />Nami khin khe miapaw — ang, ang kowh tainau-uüa, ang kowh naruüa hai kangchawng miuüa — klüp tawnguat dowi chekhai. Now tui ria kowi anging cham kowi khe khowm padow chowlowkkow tasen müa rutchün khawkleng mih anging dowkla reng chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NEH 5" />
  <para style="s">Ngaraima miuüa kowi Nehemia khowngah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 5:1" />Akung kowi maru kawmuüa hai amatni kowh masi hawmuüa dow akeng mih Judauüa kowi kingküaah mih laiklow tek büah sawmlawm khai. <verse eid="NEH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 5:2" />Tawngbak mih tek mih, “Anging kowh dow chauüa kawmma. Naiawng rakowi nasingla kownkow anging vüi chakkham lakke huma chekhai,” pabüah khai. <verse eid="NEH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 5:3" />Akeng mih maru tek mih, “Khown kuak rakowi anging naranla chakkham kownkow anging kowh krawng bawn, grep krum hai kim üa ün anging cham pawngta takla khai,” pabüah khai. <verse eid="NEH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 5:4" />Tawngbak mih plan tek iawk mih, “Anging kowh krawng bawn muh hai grep krum muh napela kownkow anging lowi pawk takla khai. <verse eid="NEH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 5:5" />A-i bowkbowk achen sang taih diah. Nachenganchepaw sing müa tangka pawisa lakke rakowi anging kowh chauüa kowi maru nachangla nar kownkow anging cham sumta takla khai, now anging kowh chamauüa kowi khowm maru nachangla narma kownkow anging rik sumta mih uowi ne khowk chekhai. Kawmat mih anging kowh ia changra tawngpaw uowi dowi bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow anging kowh krawng bawn hai grep krum dow akeng maru-uüa pawta anging bowk khowk,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="NEH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 5:6" />Maru kawmuüa naiawng chawkla lai prungrung mih ang ta hanow nowm nowm ang kunmarau khai. <verse eid="NEH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 5:7" />Now naiawngün lawnguan kowi ang pawtuak khai. Nami kung kowi dow maru iukuüa hai aluchowuüa kowi ang tek pe mih, “Enni kowh tainau-uüa kowi enni pe khawiah tangka mih khin khe enni paw pe achüt khai,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi naiawngün lawnguan kowi aluchowuüa hown natalawp kownkow takua talawmra kri ang thawp lowk khai. <verse eid="NEH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 5:8" />Nami takua talawmra kowi ang tek pe aluchowuüa mih, “A-i tainau Judauüa pungmadawng hownia maru nachangla nar kownkow akeng pren kowi cham sumta miuüa kowi dow ia mowr anging krawi klanta khowk. Nachenganchepaw enni dow naiawngün enni kowh tainau-uüa kowi maru nachangla nar kownkow enni plan sumah khai iawk. Kawmat dow kowbüah kowi a-i aklan takla iawk nadowi ü?” pape khai. Nami laiklow tata hanow aluchowuüa dow ka lai tekra dowi bowt kowh ririmma uowi büah khai.<verse eid="NEH 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 5:9" />Ang plan tek pe amatni mih, “Enni kowh lup taka dowi. Akeng chenchap a-i kowh ransu-uüa naia kharela a-i dowi kownkow a-i kowh Thurai kowi ringkawma hown kram se a-i nauowi kown takla. <verse eid="NEH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 5:10" />Ang, ang tainau hai ang kowh maru iukuüa paw maru kawmuüa kowi tangka pawisa hai luprak ün pe khawiah mih uowi tak. Nachenganchepaw chu, naiawngün hownia nau ka achüt tak mih a-i lawtta pe diah sik. <verse eid="NEH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 5:11" />Amatni kowh krawng bawn, grep krum, kanrawn khang hai kim üa ün kawmat planta pe büa diah. Now tangka pawisa, luprak, grep tui sar hai kanrawn sau enni pe khawiah mih kowi enni paw pe achüt mih paw planta pe diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 5:12" />Nami laiklow tata hanow amatni tek ang mih, “En tek iawng anging chang kown towbowt. Amatni hownia kowh anging pawah mih maten dow anging planta pe bowk kown towbowt. Now amatni hownia tawngpaw anging nakük pe kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:12">Nami kung kowi dow uamowuüa kowi ang uang hawla khai. Now maru iukuüa hai aluchowuüa kowi dow amatni takhamta iawng nachang lup kown mih uamowuüa pur kowi ang pe takhamah khai. <verse eid="NEH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 5:13" />Now ang khupah mih kowrmow pur pra kowh uen kowi dowkah hanow thürah se ang tek pe mih, “Mami sawi kham laiklow chün dowi mih maru-uüa kowi dow amatni kowh kim hai dawngthawnguan hownia Thurai mih maiawng nathürah kown. Amatni kowh uowi mih maten dow Thurai mih napawta pe bowk kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:13">Nami laiklow ta hanow maru kawmuüa maten tek mih, “Amen,” pabüah khai. Now amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büah khai. Nami kung kowi maru iukuüa dow amatni takhamta iawng chang büah khai.<verse eid="NEH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nehemia kowh akawklawma mih saktuak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 5:14" />Persia pren kowi Artazerzes chowm mang mih 20 ning hownia 32 ning mowr khe Juda pren kowi kruitown mih dow ang chekhai. Nami laipre ning ang kruitown pren mih khin khe ang hai ang tainau-uüa dow pren kruitown mih vüi kowi kowh chakkham tawi cha dowi chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 5:15" />Nachenganchepaw ang dowi rawn kowi kowh kruitown miuüa dow maru kawmuüa luk kowi kurdik huma tang pe khai, now chakkham hai grep tui ün kük pe reng chekhai. Nami klen kowi ni towng tai 40 iun chi maru kawmuüa hownia amatni paw pe reng chekhai. Naiawngün kruitown miuüa kowh maru iukuüa khowm maru kawmuüa luk kowi changah anowng apowng reng chekhai. Nachenganchepaw ang dow Thurai kowi kram kowh naiawng mih lup ang chang dowi chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 5:16" />Ang dow naplan chang tap kown mih lup kowi ang lang towsak rowt khai. Tawng iawng mih krawng bawn paw ang tawi ran dowi chekhai. Ang kowh naruüa maten paw ang hown nami lup tawi taiua chang khai.<verse eid="NEH 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 5:17" />Nami klen kowi ang cha chakkham mih khin khe paw Juda maru iukuüa 150 ia hailawm ariaret kowi kowh chenchapuüa hownia uang miuüa ün tawi taiua cha chakkham reng chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 5:18" />Ang dow ni towng chiala apum, lang kloah mih ruapurla taruk pum hai ua sangrum chi aeng müa pek takla reng. Nami klen kowi hamüt ni kowi pakat chi grep tui huma ang pe takla reng. Nachenganchepaw pren kruitown mih chakkham dow katpaw ang tawi kük dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün ang kük hanow maru kawmuüa luk kowi mangmu nahu ngamlam kown towbowt.<verse eid="NEH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 5:19" />Aw ang kowh Thurai, maiawngün maru kawmuüa vüi ang chang pe mih lup maten hangkow tamata diah, now pe ang iungra diah.<verse eid="NEH 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NEH 6" />
  <para style="s">Nehemia kowi kingküaah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 6:1" />Sanbalat, Tobia, Arab prenchak Gesem hai anging kowh akeng mih ransu-uüa dow ang ki rawta tap khowk pami hai tawng mih re-e paw tap takhue mih uowi dowi bowt pami satang ta büah khai. Tawkche nakhowk khe paw tapplawt kowi dow ang thawp pe abüng dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 6:2" />Nami khin khe Sanbalat hai Gesem iüah uang krawi tek ang mih, “Chu, Ono dowm nai kowi kowh kua kowi a-i takrum diah sik,” pakhai. Tawkche amatchi sangkrang mih dow napiakta ang kownkow chekhai pami ang tukta pe khai. <verse eid="NEH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 6:3" />Naiawng rakowi krawi chin maru hanow ang krawi tek pe mih, “Pankrima mih lup ang chang reng tak. Naiawng rakowi ang ia uang dowi tak tham. Towla lup kawk kowh enchi tut-e ang uang e dow ang kowh lup chang nataing kown chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="NEH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 6:4" />Amatchi dow naiawng hai aplan aplan tali kat mowr uang krawi phowng ang satang khai. Ang paw aplan aplan naiawng ang krawi klangah reng chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 6:5" />Nami kung kowi paw Sanbalat dow aia kowh nar kowi uang chin hanow nami satang uang plan phowng ang khai. Now anar rut kowi dow tuk pe <char style="w">mur</char> dowi mih ahoma mih chasak uowi lowk chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 6:6" />Nami chasak kowi arui uowi mih dow, “En hai Judauüa plan thawp tap mih dow Persia mang kowi nakingküala kownkow pe pami akeng chenchapuüa tekla prung mih ang ta, now Gesem paw tek ang khowk. Nami klen kowi Judauüa luk kowi en nachowm mang kownkow en sangkrang mih paw Gesem tek ang khowk. <verse eid="NEH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 6:7" />Nami klen kowi Juda pren mang dow en chowbowt pami Jerusalem marow kowi nakrawi phuang kownkow risiuüa kowi khowm padow en towta hüah khowk pe. Nami satang dow mang Artazerzes tut-e nakowting kown chowbowt. Naiawng rakowi chu, nami lawnguan kowi akat sang a-i taiua talawp diah sik,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 6:8" />Nakhowk khe ang krawi plan tek pe mih, “En tekah mih aching nadowi. Naiawngün dow en sak nau iawng en thawnah mih laiklow chowtaih,” pape khai. <verse eid="NEH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 6:9" />Naiawng anging kowh ransu-uüa uang krawi krawk mih dow anging kowh lup pacham taingta lah pakowh chekhai. Nachenganchepaw ang awr chup Thurai mih, “Aw Thurai, pe ang kür diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 6:10" />Akat khe Delaia chapa Semaia hown nakowtalawp kownkow aia kim kowi ang kowkowi khai. Delaia dow Mehetabel kowh chapa chekhai. Naiawng ang kowkowi mih khin khe Semaia dow kim hownia ia lawt dowi chekhai. Aia tek ang mih, “Chu, Thurai chup kim kowi kowh Chimsaima Mih Arah kowi achi kowtapet diah sik, now kimbüng ün achi krawi büngta bowk diah sik. Tawngplawng kowchow panow iak-e khe en kowh ransu-uüa nauang saita en kownkow uang tarü khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 6:11" />Nachenganchepaw ang tek pe mih, “Ang iawng mih maru napowt kown mih taka bow? Now ang iawng mih maru asak naplaila kownkow Thurai chup kim kowi kowkowi kown mih taka bow? En tek iawng ang ia chang dowi tham,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 6:12" />Semaia uang tek ang mih laiklow dow Thurai hownia kowh nadowi pami ang tukta khai. Naiawng aia uang tek ang mih dow Tobia hai Sanbalat iüah peah tangka rakowi chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 6:13" />Semaia kowi amatchi ngaah mih dow nauang krawk ang hanow ang pacham chang ngak lah pakowh chekhai. Nahanow ang kowh ming iung nang iung piak ang hanow nape ang rukrai iüah kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 6:14" />Naiawng rakowi ang chup Thurai mih, “Aw ang kowh Thurai, Tobia hai Sanbalat iüah changah mih angak maten tuakah reng diah, now ripah diah. Masiuüa risi Noadia hai akeng mih risiuüa krawk ang miuüa kowi paw tuakah reng diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ki thawp tap mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 6:15" />Tap thawp takla mih dow bowkbowk kowi 52 ni chekhai. Now ki thawp tap mih dow Elul la kowi lacher 25 ni khe chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 6:16" />Nami satang tata hanow anging kowh ransu-uüa maten hai anging riaret kowi kowh akeng chenchapuüa maten dow lainowmma kram khai bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Thurai khowng anging luk kowi nami lup anging ia chang mih chekhai pami amatni tuk khai bowt.<verse eid="NEH 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 6:17" />Nami 52 ni kowi Juda aluchowuüa hai Tobia büah dow tape chasak reng chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 6:18" />Tawngbak mih Judauüa dow Tobia kowi natangila kownkow takham khowk chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow Ara chapa Sekania kowh mawkchow chekhai. Nami klen kowi Tobia chapa Jehohanan chawngah mih paw Berekia chapa Mesulam kowh chama chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 6:19" />Juda aluchowuüa dow Tobia changah mih lup iung maten uang tek ang reng, now ang tekah mih laiklow paw aia kowi kowtek pe reng chekhai. Tobia dow krawk ang kownkow aplan aplan krawi sak ang cha reng chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 6:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NEH 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 7:1" />Ki thawp tap kung kowi dow tapplawt maten kowi ang krawi thawp pe abüng khai, now tapplawt chawng miuüa, meng sarauüa hai Leviuüa kowi dow amatni kowh lup nachang kownkow ang towah khai <verse eid="NEH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 7:2" />Now ang tainau Hanani hai akhawtma mih kim chawng mih siphai aluchow Hanania iüah kowi dow nakruitown Jerusalem marow kown mih kurdik ang peah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Hanania dow kaah sakowm mih maru chekhai, now aia dow akeng mih maru-uüa lak-e Thurai kowi lang ringkaw hai lang kram mih maru chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 7:3" />Now amatchi kowi ang tek pe mih, “Sat adenma den dowi mowr Jerusalem marow tapplawt ün hangkow ho iüa diah. Kangchawng miuüa powt dowi rawn khe kimbüng ün enching nabüngta kown takla, now klia paw enching nakliata kown takla. Kangchawng mih maru dow Jerusalem marow hownia kowh maru-uüa kowi enching natowah kown takla. Amatni dow chowlowkkow kangchawngra re-e ne, now chowlowkkow kim re-e ne pacham uowi lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 7:4" />Amatni kowi dow naiawng ang khowm bowk pe lup khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Jerusalem marow dow aiukma chekhai. Nachenganchepaw maru dow khowt pat uowi dowi tak, now kim sar ün paw thawp dowi tak chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cham takhangra hownia uang plan miuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 7:5" />Akung kowi maru iukuüa, aluchowuüa hai iawngpa mih maru-uüa kowi arasang kuaah lawmah hanow chowlowkkow krungchak ming mih ming tang bowih naruiah kown mih Thurai pe ang saktuak khai. Uang rik plan mih maru-uüa kowh ming tang uowi mih charam dow ang kata khowk. Nami charam kowi dow maiawng arui uowi khai:<verse eid="NEH 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 7:6" />Maiawngünuüa dow Babulawn pren kowi cham takhangra hownia kowh uang plan miuüa ming chekhai. Amatni dow Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar chowm mang khe khümla now Babulawn pren kowi pawla mih maru-uüa chekhai. Amatni dow nami hownia uang lawt hanow Jerusalem marow hai Juda pren kowi kowh amatni chowlowkkow krungchakuüa uowi rah marow hai kua kowi uang uowi büah khai. <verse eid="NEH 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 7:7" />Naiawngün uang plan miuüa kowh aluchowuüa dow Zerubabel, Jesua, Nehemia, Azaria, Ramia, Nahamani, Mawrdekai, Bilsan, Misperet, Bigvai, Nehum hai Bana büah chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:7">Uang plan mih Israel kachakuüa nget maru iun dow maiawng. <verse eid="NEH 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 7:8" />Paraws krungchak hownia 2,172 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 7:9" />Sefatia krungchak hownia 372 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 7:10" />Ara krungchak hownia 652 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 7:11" />Pahat-Moab krungchak Jesua hai Joab krungchak hownia 2,818 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 7:12" />Elam krungchak hownia 1,254 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 7:13" />Zatu krungchak hownia 845 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 7:14" />Zakai krungchak hownia 760 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 7:15" />Bani krungchak hownia 648 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 7:16" />Bebai krungchak hownia 628 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 7:17" />Azgad krungchak hownia 2,322 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 7:18" />Adonikam krungchak hownia 667 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 7:19" />Bigvai krungchak hownia 2,067 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 7:20" />Adin krungchak hownia 655 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 7:21" />Ater krungchak hownia 98 ia; Ater dow Hezekia chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 7:22" />Hasum krungchak hownia 328 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 7:23" />Bezai krungchak hownia 324 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 7:24" />Harif krungchak hownia 112 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 7:25" />now Gibeawn krungchak hownia 95 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 7:26" />Mami dow amatni chowlowkkow pipu-uüa marow kowi uang plan miuüa chekhai. Bethlehem marow hai Netofa marow kowi 188 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 7:27" />Anathawt marow kowi 128 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 7:28" />Bet-Azmavet marow kowi 42 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 7:29" />Kiriat-Jearim, Kefira hai Berawt marow kowi 743 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 7:30" />Rama hai Geba marow kowi 621 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 7:31" />Mikmas marow kowi 122 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 7:32" />Bethel hai Ai marow kowi 123 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 7:33" />Nebo marow kowi 52 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 7:34" />satkup pra kowh Elam marow kowi 1,254 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 7:35" />Harim marow kowi 320 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 7:36" />Jeriko marow kowi 345 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 7:37" />Lawd, Hadid hai Ono marow kowi 721 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 7:38" />now Sena marow kowi 3,930 ia chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 7:39" />Mami dow uamow krungchakuüa hownia kowh uang plan miuüa chekhai. Jedaia krungchak pungmadawng hownia Jesua krungchak hownia 973 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 7:40" />Imer krungchak hownia 1,052 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 7:41" />Pasur krungchak hownia 1,247 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 7:42" />Harim krungchak hownia 1,017 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 7:43" />Levi chenchap hownia kowh uang plan mih maru iun dow maiawng. Hodavia chuprek chaprek Jesua hai Kadmiel krungchak hownia 74 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 7:44" />Meng sara Asaf krungchak hownia 148 ia, <verse eid="NEH 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 7:45" />kangchawng mih Salum, Ater, Talmawn, Akub, Hatita hai Sobai krungchak hownia 138 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 7:46" />Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup chang mih uang plan miuüa dow Ziha kowh krungchakuüa, Hasufa kowh krungchakuüa, Tabaawt kowh krungchakuüa, <verse eid="NEH 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 7:47" />Keraws kowh krungchakuüa, Sia kowh krungchakuüa, Padawn kowh krungchakuüa, <verse eid="NEH 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NEH 7:48" />Lebana kowh krungchakuüa, Hagaba kowh krungchakuüa, Salmai kowh krungchakuüa, <verse eid="NEH 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NEH 7:49" />Hanan kowh krungchakuüa, Gidel kowh krungchakuüa, Gahar kowh krungchakuüa, <verse eid="NEH 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NEH 7:50" />Reaia kowh krungchakuüa, Rezin kowh krungchakuüa, Nekoda kowh krungchakuüa, <verse eid="NEH 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NEH 7:51" />Gazam kowh krungchakuüa, Uza kowh krungchakuüa, Pasea kowh krungchakuüa, <verse eid="NEH 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NEH 7:52" />Besai kowh krungchakuüa, Meunim kowh krungchakuüa, Nefusesim kowh krungchakuüa, <verse eid="NEH 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NEH 7:53" />Bakbuk kowh krungchakuüa, Hakufa kowh krungchakuüa, Harhur kowh krungchakuüa, <verse eid="NEH 7:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NEH 7:54" />Bazlit kowh krungchakuüa, Mehida kowh krungchakuüa, Harsa kowh krungchakuüa, <verse eid="NEH 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NEH 7:55" />Barkaws kowh krungchakuüa, Sisera kowh krungchakuüa, Tema kowh krungchakuüa, <verse eid="NEH 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NEH 7:56" />Nezia kowh krungchakuüa hai Hatifa kowh krungchak büah chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NEH 7:57" />Maiawngün dow mang Sawlawmawn kowh nar uang plan mih krungchakuüa chekhai. Naiawngünuüa dow Sotai krungchak, Soferet krungchak, Perida krungchak, <verse eid="NEH 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NEH 7:58" />Jala krungchak, Darkawn krungchak, Gidel krungchak, <verse eid="NEH 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NEH 7:59" />Sefatia krungchak, Hatil krungchak, Pokeret-Hazebaim krungchak hai Amawn krungchak chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NEH 7:60" />Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup chang mih hai mang Sawlawmawn kowh naruüa dow bowkbowk kowi 392 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 7:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61-62" style="v" sid="NEH 7:61-62" />Nami klen kowi Tel-Mela marow, Tel-Harsa marow, Cherub marow, Adan marow hai Imer marow hownia kowh maru paw uang tawi plan 642 ia khai. Tawkche amatni dow amatni Israel chenchap pami amatra tawngpaw nowng tüng büah dowi chekhai. Amatni dow Delaia krungchak, Tobia krungchak hai Nekoda krungchak chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 7:61-62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NEH 7:63" />Uamow kowh krungchak hownia uang plan miuüa dow Hobaia krungchak, Hakawz krungchak hai Barzilai krungchak büah chekhai. (Barzilai dow Gilead süng kowi kowh Barzilai chama hown tachawng khai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowh ming paw naiawng rükah mih chekhai). <verse eid="NEH 7:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NEH 7:64" />Amatni dow ming tang bowih kowi amatni kowh ming krawi cham büah chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw krawi ka cham büah dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow uamow lup hownia tabat takla khai. <verse eid="NEH 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NEH 7:65" />Now Juda pren kruitown mih dow Urim hai Thumim pami hown CHAKRAMANG tut-e uamow lünta dowi mowr changla phuchua mih uanh maten nacha dowi kown mih amatni kowi tek pe khai.<verse eid="NEH 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NEH 7:66" />Juda pren kowi kowh uang plan mih maru iun dow bowkbowk kowi 42,360 ia chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 7:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NEH 7:67" />Nami klen kowi narma hai narla 7,337 ia, now masiuüa hai kachakuüa meng sara paw 245 ia tak chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 7:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NEH 7:68" />Kawrnga dow 736 pum, kawrngaramchük chah dow 245 pum, <verse eid="NEH 7:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NEH 7:69" />ut dow 435 pum, now kawrngaramchük dow 6,720 pum chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 7:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="NEH 7:70" />Now krungchak kowi kowh lang kri mih pungmadawng hownia Thurai chup kim chang müa vüi uang pe uanap ne khai. Pren kruitown mih dow kuh raiat set, bia 50 klüng hai uamowuüa vüi tawnguat 530 theng pren kruitown mih kowh dawngthawnguan towk rah kowi uang pawla khai. <verse eid="NEH 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NEH 7:71" />Tawngbak mih dow nami lup chang müa vüi kowi kuh 168 set hai tai 1,245 set dawngthawnguan towk rah kowi uang pawla khai. <verse eid="NEH 7:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="NEH 7:72" />Now tawngbak mih maru-uüa hownia dow kuh 168 set, tai 1,130 set hai uamowuüa vüi tawnguat 67 theng uang pawla khai.<verse eid="NEH 7:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="NEH 7:73" />Uamowuüa, Leviuüa, meng sarauüa, kangchawng miuüa, Thurai chup kim lup chang miuüa dow Jerusalem marow re-e kowh kua kowi uowi büah khai. Now iawngpa mih Israeluüa dow Jerusalem marow re-e kowh kua kowi ne, now amatni chowlowkkow pipu-uüa kowh marow kowi ne krawi uowi khai.<verse eid="NEH 7:73" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NEH 8" />
  <para style="s">Maru kawmuüa kowi Ezra phat pe ari aiang bowih mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 8:1" />Now ranit la kung kowi dow maru maten mih Tui Tapplawt pur kowi kowh akuangma mih arah kowi takua talawm khai. Nakhowk khe amatni dow Israeluüa vüi Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG peah mih ari aiang bowih nauang pawla kownkow kawngmu sara Ezra kowi tek pe khai. <verse eid="NEH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 8:2" />Now ranit la kowi kowh lacher pani khe dow uamow Ezra mih masiuüa kachakuüa hai sünta kowh tukta miuüa maten pur kowi ari aiang bowih mih uang pawla khai bowt. <verse eid="NEH 8:2" /><verse number="3-6" style="v" sid="NEH 8:3-6" />Now nami ari aiang bowih mih maru kawmuüa kowi naphat pe kownkow Ezra dow singh hown kowh thawpah mih prowng kowi kowphüt khai bowt. Nakhowk khe aia kowh iowng rah dow alowngma chekhai rakowi aia kowi dow maru kawmuüa khi-ah bowk chekhai. Aia dow Tui Tapplawt re-e kowh akuangma mih arah kowi masiuüa kachakuüa hai sünta kowh tukta mih maru maten pra dangah hanow rauchow hownia sat downg mowr nami bowih mih phat pe khai, now maru kawmuüa maten dow süngürma hown sünta rimrim khai. Nami bowih aia lowt mih khin khe maru kawmuüa maten dow awr iowng khai. Nakhowk khe aia dow CHAKRAMANG lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai kowi rowsiah khai, now maru kawmuüa dow chawk rut se tek mih, “Amen! Amen!” pakhai. Nami kung kowi dow krawng kowi tabawkah krawm hanow CHAKRAMANG kowi chupah büah khai. Nami khin khe aia hawmlawm prakowi iowng miuüa dow Matithia, Sema, Anaia, Uria, Hilkia hai Maseia büah chekhai, now aia lakuai prakowi iowng miuüa dow Pedaia, Misael, Malkija, Hasum, Hasbadana, Zekaria hai Mesulam büah chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 8:3-6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 8:7" />Nami khin khe Levi chenchap hownia kowh Jesua, Bani, Serebia, Jamin, Akub, Sabethai, Hodia, Maseia, Kelita, Azaria, Jozabad, Hanan hai Pelaia büah dow ari aiang lawnguan kowi nami re-e kowh iowng mih maru-uüa kowi tüngsangah khai. <verse eid="NEH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 8:8" />Ezra phat pe mih Thurai kowh ari aiang bowih dow maru kawmuüa pacham tukta lah pakowh amatni phat pe hanow nami auan phuang pe khai.<verse eid="NEH 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 8:9" />Nami kung kowi dow pren kruitown mih Nehemia, uamow hai kawngmu sara Ezra hown maru kowi tüngsang mih Leviuüa tek pe maru kawmuüa mih, “Ani kowh ni dow CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai vüi chimsaima chekhai. Naiawng rakowi kar hai nguk hown miapaw hang uowi büa diah,” pakhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow maru kawmuüa mih ari aiang laiklow tata hanow kar bowk khai.<verse eid="NEH 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 8:10" />Maru kawmuüa kowi Nehemia tek pe mih, “Kim kowi kowpowt büah hanow chak iung kham iung kowcha kowkham büa diah, now cha kown kham kown ka dowi miuüa kowi enni kowh chakkham retla pe büa diah. Ani kowh ni dow a-i kowh CHAKRAMANG vüi chimsaima chekhai. Naiawng rakowi hang sak piak büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG pe mih awmrawmra dow enni kowh kürra chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 8:11" />Now maru kawmuüa kowi Leviuüa paw tawi tek pe mih, “Ririmma uowi büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ani kowh ni dow chimsaima chekhai. Hangkow sak piak büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 8:12" />Nahanow maru kawmuüa dow awmrawmma hown nacha nakham kownkow hai ka dowi miuüa kowi naretla pe chakkham kownkow chowlowkkow kim kowi powt khai bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowi tek pe mih laiklow maten dow tukta büah bowk khowk chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Pawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 8:13" />Now nami la kowi kowh lacher pre ni khe dow chowlowkkow krungchak aluchowuüa, uamowuüa hai Leviuüa mih ari aiang klangiungma natukla kownkow kawngmu sara Ezra tut-e uang takua talawm khai. <verse eid="NEH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 8:14" />Nakhowk khe amatni dow Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah mih ari aiang bowih kowi tawng chow arui uowi mih khi büah khai. Nakowi arui uowi mih, “Ranit la kowi kowh pawi khe dow Israeluüa mih te kowi nauowi kown. <verse eid="NEH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 8:15" />Now amatni kowh kua maten hai Jerusalem marow kowi nakrawi chia nakrawi phuang büah kown mih, ‘Ari aiang kowi arui uowi iawng enni mih hungma mawngma süng kowi cham krawi kowi büa diah, now nathawpla te kownkow kimtawn kanrawn hai kaurawng kanrawn mia, naingsa singh mia, chekmarawng singh mia hai aram chakma mih singh mia uang pawla büa diah,’ napa kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 8:16" />Naiawng rakowi maru kawmuüa dow cham krawi kowi hanow uang pawla singh mia khai bowt. Now tawngbak mih dow amatni kowh kimluk kowi, tawngbak mih dow amatni kowh viadawng kowi, tawngbak mih dow Thurai chup kim viadawng kowi, tawngbak mih dow Tui Tapplawt re-e kowh akuangma mih arah kowi, tawngbak mih dow Efraim Tapplawt re-e kowh akuangma mih arah kowi amatni vüi thawp te khai. <verse eid="NEH 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 8:17" />Cham takhangra hownia kowh uang plan mih maten dow thawp te büah hanow naiawngün te kowi uowi büah khai. Nun kowh chapa Josua chowng hownia nami ni mowr Israeluüa mih naiawng chang dowi bowt chekhai. Nami ni dow amatni mih lainowmma piaw khai.<verse eid="NEH 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 8:18" />Pawi uown ni hownia pawi chur ni mowr Ezra dow ni towng Thurai kowh ari aiang bowih maru kawmuüa kowi phat pe khai. Amatni dow ranit ni mowr nami pawi sun büah khai, now raiat ni mih ni khe dow ari aiang kowi uowi iawng amülüng mih takua talawmra khin sunah büah khai.<verse eid="NEH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NEH 9" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa taphuang angak mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 9:1" />Nami ranit la kowi kowh 24 ni mih ni khe Israeluüa mih takua talawm hanow khang hawm khai, now khup sala uan büah hai lu kowi prui dinchow büah khai. <verse eid="NEH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 9:2" />Israeluüa maten dow akeng chenchap maten hownia kowmatia kowi lang takraah büah khai. Amatni dow iowng se amatni kowh angak hai amatni pipu-uüa kowh angak mih taphuang khai. <verse eid="NEH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 9:3" />Amatni dow pani kowi sum nari mowr chi CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai ari aiang bowih mih iowng se phat büah khai. Now sum nari mowr dow taphuang angak hai CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai kowi chupiia büah khai. <verse eid="NEH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 9:4" />Nakhowk khe Jesua, Bani, Kadmiel, Sebania, Buni, Serebia, Bani hai Kenani büah dow amatni kowh prowng kowi iowng se atün atünma CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai tut-e awr lü awr leng khai. <verse eid="NEH 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 9:5" />Akung kowi Leviuüa pungmadawng hownia Jesua, Kadmiel, Bani, Hasabneia, Serebia, Hodia, Sebania hai Pethahia büah tek mih, “Awr rü büah hanow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi rowsi büa diah. Aia dow chowngchowng saksakma sing uowi reng mih chekhai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 9:5">Nami kung kowi dow amatni chup Thurai mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh ming kraingma mih dow aring hai akiow pacham uowi reng lah. En dow anging tek en awmrawm lai mih hai anging kiow en mih lak-e lang kri lang kraing chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 9:6" />En chowtaih CHAKRAMANG. Mukuang hai kuang dawng hown nami lak kowi kowh uowi mih maten, lusa pren hai nami luk kowi kowh uowi mih maten, now sata hai nami lak kowi kowh uowi mih maten thawp mih dow en chowtaih. En dow bowkbowk kowi pe asak khai. En kowi dow mukuang kowi kowh uowi miuüa maten chupiia en reng chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 9:7" />“En dow CHAKRAMANG Thurai chekhai. Abram kowi en uang ruiah hanow Kaldaiuüa pren kowi kowh Ur marow hownia en uang lawtla khai, now aia ming dow Abraham pahai en rük pe khai. <verse eid="NEH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 9:8" />Aia kowh sak kaah sakowm mih en khi pe hanow Kananuüa, Hituüa, Amawruüa, Perizuüa, Jebusuüa hai Girgasuüa pren aia krungchak kowi napeah kown mih aia hown en tatow sangbowk laitawm khai. En dow achinawmma chekhai rakowi en kowh laikham en townah reng khai.<verse eid="NEH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 9:9" />“Aigupta pren kowi anging kowh pipu-uüa kham ngare mih en khi chekhai. Sata Rik pang kowi kowh amatni kar klow dow en sünta pe khai. <verse eid="NEH 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 9:10" />Anging kowh pipu-uüa luk kowi bawrima hown Aiguptauüa changah anowng apowng mih en khi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Faraw hai aia kowh maru iukuüa hown aia pren kowi kowh maru maten kowi amatra hai awdara lup en tüng pe khai. Naiawng en chang pe mih hownia en kowh ming iung nang iung dow en townah reng chekhai. Nami dow kawmat pat uowi reng chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 9:11" />Anging pipu-uüa pur kowi dow sata tui pre bak en chang pe khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow bawn kangkhawngma iawng ia pown sata khai. Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi kowh uang kawikrawiah miuüa kowi dow tui kowi kowh huaklu nip iawng en pe tamirah khai. <verse eid="NEH 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 9:12" />Ni-e khe dow uangnim iowng chunglung mih iawng anging kowh pipu-uüa kowi en pawla khai, now uar-e khe dow maih iowng chunglung mih iawng amatni mangra tia kowi en tawi nowi pe khai.<verse eid="NEH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 9:13" />“Sinai hungh kowi en uang dowmah hanow mukuang pren hownia amatni hown en uang taklang khai. Nami khin khe amatni kowi dow ari aiang, ari arow hai ana pek iungma mih en uang peah khai. <verse eid="NEH 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 9:14" />En kowh Tanai Ni chimsaima mih lawnguan kowi amatni kowi en uang phuang pe khai, now en kowh nar Mosi hownia amatni kowi ana pek, rirow hai ari aiang en peah khai. <verse eid="NEH 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 9:15" />Amatni kowh hawm sakkrai narimla kownkow mukuang pren hownia en uang iu peah chakkham khai, now amatni kowh tui sakkrai narimla kownkow huamang hownia tui en uang pe lawtah khai. Amatni kowi napeah kownkow en khamah mih pren kowi kowkowi hanow kowpowng kown mih amatni kowi en peah ana khai.<verse eid="NEH 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 9:16" />“Nachenganchepaw anging kowh pipu-uüa kowh chowm krang uowi krang dow bawrira atekma chekhai. Amatni dow lai üa kürma chekhai, now en kowh ana pek chün dowi chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 9:17" />Amatni dow chün lai kown nau dowi, now amatni pungmadawng kowi kowh en chang pe awdara lup mih maten paw amatni dow sak kowi towah dowi chekhai. Amatni dow üa lai hanow Aigupta pren kowi nakowuowi nar iawk kownkow thik aluchow lowk ia khai. Nachenganchepaw en dow maru kowh angak lawtta pe reng, saksing sanara atekma, kunmarau naklak dowi, now sakraura achur uowi dowi mih Thurai chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow en nuata hüah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 9:17" /><verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="NEH 9:18-19" />Nami klen kowi amatni dow amatni vüi sawn chia chah rup lowk khai. Now tek büah mih, ‘Mami chowbowt enni kowh thurai; Aigupta pren hownia uang lawtla enni mih mami chowbowt,’ pakhai. Naiawng hai lainowmma amatni pe en rukrai khowk chepaw en kowh saksing sanara hu lai rakowi süngrüp süngkangma kowi amatni kowi en nuata hüah dowi. Amatni kowi nakruila kownkow ni-e khe uangnim iowng chunglung mih iawng en tow pe mih dow en henta pe dowi chekhai, now uar-e khe natüng pe tiama kownkow maih iowng chunglung en tow pe mih paw amatni pur hownia en henta pe dowi chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 9:18-19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 9:20" />Amatni kowi natüngsangah kownkow en kowh aiungma mih lümla en peah khai. Amatni nachaah kownkow en peah mih <char style="w">manna kawm</char> en taingta pe dowi chekhai, now amatni tui sakkrai narimla kownkow en peah tui khai. <verse eid="NEH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 9:21" />Amatni kowi dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi 40 ning mowr en thumah khai. Nami khin khe amatni dow tawngpaw khawr dowi; amatni kowh tawnguat paw tu dowi, now amatni kowh klowng paw bau dowi chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 9:22" />“Akung kowi dow pren hai chenchap ahuma amatni rut kowi en ap pe khai. Now naiawngün pren kowi kowh arah maten kowi amatni kowi en krawi pe uowiah khai. Mang Sihun kowh Hesbawn marow hai Awk mang kowh Basan süng paw amatni kowi en pe powngah khai. <verse eid="NEH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 9:23" />Amatni kowi dow kuang dawng kowi kowh krek iawng chauüa ahuma en pe kaah khai. Now amatni pipu-uüa kowi nape powngah pren kownkow en tek pe mih kowi amatni kowi dow en kowpawla khai. <verse eid="NEH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 9:24" />Now amatni kowh krungchakuüa dow nami pren kowi kowkowi hanow nami pren mih kowpowngta khai. Amatni pur kowi dow nami pren kowi kowh hawt uowi mih Kananuüa kowi en pe khamah sum khai. Amatni nau iawng naia changla kownkow nami pren kowi kowh hawt uowi mih Kananuüa, manguüa hai pren kowi kowh akeng chenchapuüa kowi amatni rut kowi en ap pe khai. <verse eid="NEH 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 9:25" />Amatni dow tap uowi mih marow hai asi uowi mih krawng bawn ahuma krawi powngta khai. Nami klen kowi uanh iung atekma mih kim hai tuikuam thai ia ün, grep krum, kanrawn khang hai uih singh ün ahuma krawi powngta büah khai. Amatni dow chakkham aduma ka cha rakowi kow iungma uowi büah khai, now en peah mih iungra ahuma ka büah khai.<verse eid="NEH 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 9:26" />“Nachenganchepaw amatni dow chün lai dowi kowi kingküa en khai; en peah mih ari aiang nuata büah khai. Amatni dow en prakowi nauang planla kownkow krawi tek lai mih risiuüa kowi saita büah khai, now amatni dow lainowmma towk en kunmarau khai. <verse eid="NEH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 9:27" />Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow ransu-uüa rut kowi en ap-ah khai, now ransu-uüa dow amatni kowi changah anowng apowng khai. Amatni krat mih khin khe dow amatni mih en tut-e uang nguk uang kar khai, now nami kar klow dow mukuang pren hownia en iu sünta pe khai. Now en kowh sakraura atekma rakowi amatni kowi nalawngah kownkow en kowchin pe lawng miuüa khai. Naiawngün lawng miuüa dow ransu-uüa rut hownia amatni kowi uang lawngah khai.<verse eid="NEH 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 9:28" />“Nachenganchepaw amatni ka tanai mih khin khe dow en mik kowi angakma mih lup chang büah khai iawk. Nami kung kowi dow amatni luk kowi ransu-uüa pacham chang low lah pakowh amatni kowi dow ransu-uüa rut kowi en plan ap-ah khai. Nachenganchepaw en tut-e amatni uang nguk uang kar iawk khe dow mukuang pren hownia en ta hanow en sakrauah rakowi aplan aplan en uang lawngah khai.<verse eid="NEH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 9:29" />“En kowh ari aiang prakowi nauang planla kownkow amatni kowi dow en uang tek pe khai. Nachenganchepaw amatni dow bawrima chekhai; amatni dow en kowh ana pek maten kowi lowk paw chün dowi chekhai. En kowh ana pek chün hanow maru kala singra mih kowi kingküala mih angak chang büah khai. Amatni dow lai üa kürma hai kunma khawtma chekhai; en kowh lai sünta kown nau dowi. <verse eid="NEH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 9:30" />Nachenganchepaw ning kawmma amatni luk kowi en town sak khai. En kowh risiuüa hai en kowh lümla hown kaneuma nauowi büah kownkow en uang tek pe khai. Nachenganchepaw amatni dow pe ching dowi. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow chenchap alang alangma miuüa rut kowi en cham ap-ah khai. <verse eid="NEH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 9:31" />Nachenganchepaw en kowh sakraura ahuma chekhai rakowi amatni kowi dow en chumta dowi hai en nuata dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow saksing sanara hai sakraura atekma mih Thurai chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 9:32" />“Aw anging kowh Thurai, en dow lang kri lang kraing mih, lang kür mih hai kramra uowima mih Thurai chekhai. En dow en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura laikham en townah reng. Asuria manguüa chowng hownia kawmat pat anging, anging kowh manguüa, aluchowuüa, uamowuüa, risiuüa, pipu-uüa hai en kowh maru-uüa maten kham ngare mih ditchow taih pami hangkow tuakah diah. <verse eid="NEH 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 9:33" />En pe anging ripra mih dow tawi dowi chekhai. En dow kaah sakowmma chang lup khai, now anging dow chang angak khai. <verse eid="NEH 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 9:34" />Anging kowh manguüa, aluchowuüa, uamowuüa hai pipu-uüa dow en kowh ari aiang chün dowi chekhai; en kowh ana pek hai paw sangching kown mih laiklow sünta dowi chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 9:35" />Amatni chowm mang mih khin khe amatni dow en peah mih aiukma hai asi uowima mih pren kowi aiungma uowi büah khai. Nachenganchepaw amatni dow chupiia en dowi chekhai, now angak hownia paw uang plan büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 9:36" />“Naiawng rakowi kawmat dow chak iung kham iung naka chala kownkow anging pipu-uüa kowi kowh en peah mih pren kowi anging uowi nar khai. <verse eid="NEH 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 9:37" />Anging kowh luprak dow anging kowh angak rakowi anging luk kowi nachang low kownkow en towah mih manguüa rut kowi cham ting khai bowt. Amatni dow amatni nau iawng anging buk kowi hai anging kowh tawncher hawmh luk kowi chang alow khai. Naiawng rakowi lainowmma anging ngare khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laikham charam kowi tuk pe mur mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 9:38" />Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa tek mih, “Maiawngün bowkbowk mih rakowi kawmat dow anging takham khowk, now mami laikham laiklow mih charam kowi anging ruiah khai. Nami charam kowi anging kowh aluchowuüa, Leviuüa hai uamowuüa tuk pe mur khowk chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NEH 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 10:1" />Nami laikham charam kowi rik tuk mur mih dow Hakalia chapa pren kruitown mih Nehemia chekhai, now nami kung kowi dow Zedekia. <verse eid="NEH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 10:2" />Nami kung kowi uamowuüa hownia kowh tuk mur miuüa dow Seraia, Azaria, Jeremia, <verse eid="NEH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 10:3" />Pasur, Amaria, Malkija, <verse eid="NEH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 10:4" />Hatus, Sebania, Maluk <verse eid="NEH 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 10:5" />Harim, Meremawt, Obadia, <verse eid="NEH 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 10:6" />Daniel, Ginethawn, Baruk, <verse eid="NEH 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 10:7" />Mesulam, Abija, Mijamin, <verse eid="NEH 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 10:8" />Mazia, Bilgai hai Semaia büah chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 10:9" />Leviuüa hownia kowh tuk mur miuüa dow Azania chapa Jesua, Henadad chapa Binui hai Kadmiel büah chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 10:10" />Amatni kowh tainau Sebania, Hodia, Kelita, Pelaia, Hanan, <verse eid="NEH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 10:11" />Mika, Rehawb, Hasabia, <verse eid="NEH 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 10:12" />Zakur, Serebia, Sebania, <verse eid="NEH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 10:13" />Hodia, Bani hai Beninu büah paw tawi tuk mur khai.<verse eid="NEH 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 10:14" />Aluchowuüa hownia kowh tuk mur miuüa dow Paraws, Pahat-Moab, Elam, Zatu, Bani, <verse eid="NEH 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 10:15" />Buni, Azgad, Bebai, <verse eid="NEH 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 10:16" />Adonija, Bigvai, Adin, <verse eid="NEH 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 10:17" />Ater, Hezekia, Azur, <verse eid="NEH 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 10:18" />Hodia, Hasum, Bezai, <verse eid="NEH 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 10:19" />Harip, Anathawt, Nebai, <verse eid="NEH 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 10:20" />Magpias, Mesulam, Hezir, <verse eid="NEH 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 10:21" />Mesezabel, Zadawk, Jadua, <verse eid="NEH 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 10:22" />Pelatia, Hanan, Anaia, <verse eid="NEH 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 10:23" />Hosea, Hanani, Hasub, <verse eid="NEH 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 10:24" />Halohes, Pilha, Sobek, <verse eid="NEH 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 10:25" />Rehum, Hasabna, Maseia, <verse eid="NEH 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 10:26" />Ahia, Hanan, Anan, <verse eid="NEH 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 10:27" />Maluk, Harim hai Bana büah chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Takham mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="NEH 10:28-29" />Ta lat mih maru maten — uamowuüa, Leviuüa, kangchawng miuüa, meng sarauüa, Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup chang miuüa, Thurai ana iawng nauowi kownkow amatni riaret kowi kowh akeng chenchapuüa hownia lang tahen miuüa, amatni kowh masi hawmuüa, ka sangching khowk mih amatni kowh chauüa — amatni kowh aluchowuüa hown tawi takham khai. Amatni dow Mosi kowi kowh Thurai peah mih ari aiang chün dowi hanow naka piati kown mih takham khai, now CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek hai rirow maten nachün kaneu kown mih takham khai. Amatni takham mih,<verse eid="NEH 10:28-29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 10:30" />“Anging riaret kowi kowh uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa hown anging kowh chapa chamauüa kowi anging nape tachawngah kown nadowi.<verse eid="NEH 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 10:31" />“Tanai Ni hai akeng mih chimsaima mih ni khe anging riaret kowi kowh akeng chenchapuüa uang sum uanh chepaw anging nahawt ran kown nadowi. Ranit ning chi towng anging kowh kakra lowi maten anging nalawtta kown. Anging kowh krawng bawn kowi paw anging nape tanaiah kown; anging nalupah kown nadowi.<verse eid="NEH 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 10:32" />“A-i kowh Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup chang müa ning towng tai tali gram kowi changah sum bak now pabak chi anging nape kown. <verse eid="NEH 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 10:33" />Naiawngün tai anging pe kown mih dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowh towah kown mih kawm vüi, khowmta bowkta mih pawi kowi kowh kawmdi uanap hai tikah mih uanap chang müa, Tanai Ni khe kowh phuchua chang müa, Lacher Pawi hai akeng mih khowmta bowkta mih pawi chang müa, chimsaima mih uanh naap kown mih pawi chang müa, Israeluüa kowh angak lawt lük müa uanap hai a-i kowh Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup maten naia changla kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 10:34" />“Now ari aiang kowi arui uowi iawng ning towng CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai phuchuara luk kowi naia changla tikah mih uanap kownkow tawng khe chow nacham paw sawp kown mih hai mia krungchak chow nacham paw sawp kown mih natukla kownkow anging uamowuüa, Leviuüa hai iawngpa mih maru-uüa kuak plang khai.<verse eid="NEH 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 10:35" />“Ning towng rik kuaah mih luprak hai singh towng kowi kowh uih müng dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi anging nauang pawla reng kown. <verse eid="NEH 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 10:36" />Ari aiang kowi arui uowi iawng anging kowh chapa ta, now chia, rua hai ruapur kowi kowh rik pen mih ala chah maten mih a-i kowh Thurai chup kim kowi chang lup mih uamowuüa tut-e anging nakowpawla kown.<verse eid="NEH 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 10:37" />“Nami klen kowi kawmdi, kawmdi uanap kowi kowh rik ap-ah mih, singh maten hownia kowh uih müng, grep tui sar hai rik küaah mih kanrawn sau a-i kowh Thurai chup kim kowi kowh dawngthawnguan nungra kim kowi uamowuüa tut-e anging nakowpawla kown. Now anging kowh luprak hownia hamüt bak kowi pabak mih Leviuüa tut-e nakowpawla kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow a-i kowh marow maten kowi hamüt bak kowi pabak paw reng mih dow Leviuüa chowtaih. <verse eid="NEH 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 10:38" />Leviuüa hawt paw hamüt bak kowi pabak mih khin khe amatni hown Arawn krungchak hownia kowh uamow natawi uowi lowk ia kown. Now maru uang pawla mih naiawngün uanh maten hownia changah hamüt bak kowi pabak mih dow a-i kowh Thurai chup kim kowi kowh dawngthawnguan nungra kim kowi Leviuüa nakowpawla kown. <verse eid="NEH 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 10:39" />Now dawngthawnguan nungra kim kowi kowh towklak maten kowi Israeluüa hai Leviuüa mih amatni kowh luprak, grep tui sar hai kanrawn sau nauang pawla kown. Naiawngün towklak kowi dow uanap chang müa chimsaima uanh uowi chekhai, now lup chang mih Leviuüa, kangchawng miuüa hai meng sarauüa paw tawngah khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 10:39">“A-i kowh Thurai chup kim kowi lakke mih srui anging nape reng kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NEH 11" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow kowi kowh tawi uowi miuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 11:1" />Maru kawmuüa kowh aluchowuüa dow Jerusalem marow kowi uowi khai. Now Juda hai Benjamin krungchakuüa marow kowi uowi miuüa pungmadawng kowi dow hamüt dawng kowi padawng chi chimsaima mih Jerusalem marow kowi naia uowila kownkow kuak plang büah khai. Now akeng mih taku dawng chi mih dow amatni chowlowkkow kua kowi ta uowi khai. <verse eid="NEH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 11:2" />Sak nau hown kowh Jerusalem marow kowi uang uowi kown nau miuüa kowi dow maru kawmuüa kiowah khai.<verse eid="NEH 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 11:3" />Juda hai Benjamin klen kowi kowh akeng mih Israeluüa, uamowuüa, Leviuüa, Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup chang miuüa hai mang Sawlawmawn kowh nar krungchakuüa dow amatni uowi rah marow kowi ta uowi khai. <verse eid="NEH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 11:4" />Nachenganchepaw Juda krungchak sangrum hai Benjamin krungchak sangrum dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowuowi khai.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="NEH 11:4">Juda krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 11:4">Jerusalem marow kowi tawi uowi mih dow Athaia hai Meseia chekhai. Athaia dow Uzia kowh chapa chekhai. Uzia kowh pa dow Zekaria, Zekaria kowh pa dow Amaria, Amaria kowh pa dow Sefatia, now Sefatia kowh pa dow Mahalalel chekhai. Mahalalel dow Perez krungchak pungmadawng kowi kowh lowk ia mih chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 11:5" />Meseia dow Baruk kowh chapa chekhai. Baruk kowh pa dow Kawlhoze, Kawlhoze kowh pa dow Hazaia, Hazaia kowh pa dow Adaia, Adaia kowh pa dow Joiarib, Joiarib kowh pa dow Zekaria, now Zekaria kowh pa dow Sela chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 11:6" />Jerusalem marow kowi kowh uowi mih Perez krungchak tasen kiakma mih maru iun dow 468 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Benjamin krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="NEH 11:7-8" />Benjamin krungchakuüa hownia kowh Jerusalem marow kowi tawi uowi mih dow Mesulam kowh chapa Salu chekhai. Mesulam kowh pa dow Joed, Joed kowh pa dow Pedaia, Pedaia kowh pa dow Kolaia, Kolaia kowh pa dow Maseia, Maseia kowh pa dow Ithiel, now Ithiel kowh pa dow Jesaia chekhai. Salu hown aia kowh tasin taken mih Gabbai hai Salai iüah paw tawi uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 11:7-8">Benjamin krungchak hownia kowh Jerusalem marow kowi tawi uowi mih dow bowkbowk kowi 928 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 11:7-8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 11:9" />Zikri kowh chapa Joel dow Benjamin hai Juda krungchak kowi kowh lang kri mih aluchow chekhai, now Hasenua kowh chapa Juda dow Joel kowh akhowng mih chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uamow krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 11:10" />Uamow krungchakuüa hownia kowh Jerusalem marow kowi tawi uowi miuüa dow Jedaia, Jakin hai Seraia büah chekhai. Jedaia dow Joiarib kowh chapa, now Seraia dow Hilkia chapa chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 11:11" />Hilkia kowh pa dow Mesulam, Mesulam kowh pa dow Zadawk, Zadawk kowh pa dow Meraiawt, now Meraiawt kowh pa dow Ahitub chekhai. Ahitub dow Thurai kim chawng mih kowi kowh aluchow chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 11:11" /><verse number="12-14" style="v" sid="NEH 11:12-14" />Amatni hown dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup chang mih maru akawmma tak chekhai. Jerusalem marow kowi kowh uowi mih uamow krungchakuüa dow bowkbowk kowi 822 ia chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 11:12-14">Amatni klen kowi Adaia hai aia krungchakuüa paw tawi uowi 242 ia tak chekhai. Amatni dow krungchak kowi kowh aluchow kangowh chekhai. Adaia dow Jeroham kowh chapa chekhai. Jeroham kowh pa dow Pelalia, Pelalia kowh pa dow Amzi, Amzi kowh pa dow Zekaria, Zekaria kowh pa dow Pasur, now Pasur kowh pa dow Malkija chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 11:12-14">Nami klen kowi paw Amasai hai aia kowh krungchakuüa hailawm 128 ia tak chekhai. Amatni dow tasen akürma kangowh chekhai. Amatni kowh lang kri mih dow Hagedolim kowh chapa Zabdiel chekhai. Amasai dow Azarel kowh chapa chekhai. Amasai dow Mesilemawt hai Imer kowh krungchak chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 11:12-14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Levi krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 11:15" />Levi krungchakuüa hownia kowh Jerusalem marow kowi tawi uowi mih dow Semaia chekhai. Semaia dow Hasub kowh chapa chekhai. Hasub kowh pa dow Azrikam, Azrikam kowh pa dow Hasabia, Hasabia kowh pa dow Buni chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 11:16" />Nami klen kowi Sabethai hai Jozabad iüah paw Levi krungchak kowi kowh aluchow chekhai. Amatchi dow Thurai kim uat kowi nachang lup kownkow ka kurdik mih chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 11:17" />Amatchi klen kowi awmrawm lai tek mih hai prasi lük miuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh lang kri mih Matania paw tawi uowi khai. Matania kowh pa dow Mika, Mika kowh pa dow Zabdi chekhai. Zabdi dow Asaf kowh krungchak chekhai. Nami klen kowi Matania kowh akhowng mih Bakbukia paw tawi uowi khai. Now Abda paw tawi uowi khai. Abda kowh pa dow Samua, Samua kowh pa dow Galal, now Galal kowh pa dow Jeduthum chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 11:18" />Chimsaima mih Jerusalem marow kowi Levi krungchakuüa tawi uowi mih dow bowkbowk kowi maru iun 284 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 11:19" />Tapplawt chawng mih hownia Akub hai Talmawn hai amatchi kowh auiuauüa 172 ia paw Jerusalem kowi tawi uowi chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 11:20" />Akeng mih Israeluüa, uamowuüa hai Leviuüa dow Juda pren kowi kowh amatni pipu-uüa uowi rah marow hai kua maten kowi uowi büah khai. <verse eid="NEH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 11:21" />Nachenganchepaw Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup chang miuüa dow Ofel hungh kowi uowi büah khai. Amatni kowh aluchow dow Ziha hai Gisfa iüah chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 11:22" />Jerusalem marow kowi kowh uowi mih Leviuüa kowh aluchow dow Uzi chekhai. Uzi kowh pa dow Bani, Bani kowh pa dow Hasabia, Hasabia kowh pa dow Matania, Matania kowh pa dow Mika chekhai. Mika dow Asaf kowh krungchak chekhai. Asaf krungchakuüa dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh meng tek mih chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 11:23" />Naiawngün dow mang nimkrüa kowi kowh uowi mih meng sarauüa chekhai. Amatni kowi dow ni towng mang khowm bowk pe lup reng chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 11:24" />Israel pachenma vüi Persia pren mang tut-e kowh lai tek mih dow Pethahia chekhai. Pethahia kowh pa dow Mesezabel chekhai. Mesezabel dow Zera kowh krungchak, now Zera dow Juda krungchak chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem kowi kowh tawi uowi dowi mih Israeluüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 11:25" />Juda krungchakuüa kowi kowh Jerusalem kowi tawi uowi dowi miuüa dow kua kowi amatni kowh laih hown atawnchow krawi uowi khai. Amatni pungmadawng kowi maru sangrum dow Kiriat-Arba marow, Dibawn marow hai Jekabzel marow kowi hai naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh kua ün kowi krawi uowi khai. <verse eid="NEH 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 11:26" />Nami klen kowi Jesua marow, Molada marow hai Bet-Pelet marow, <verse eid="NEH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 11:27" />Hazar-Sual marow, Ber-Seba marow hai aria aret kowi kowh kua ün kowi krawi uowi büah khai. <verse eid="NEH 11:27" /><verse number="28-30" style="v" sid="NEH 11:28-30" />Nami klen kowi Ziklak marow, Mekona marow, En-Rimawn marow, Zora marow, Jarmut marow, Zanoa marow, Adulam marow, Lakhis marow hai Azeka marow kowi krawi uowi büah khai. Now naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh kua ün kowi paw krawi uowi büah khai. Naiawng hai amatni dow Ber-Seba marow hownia Hinawm lawngrawi mowr krawi uowi büah khai.<verse eid="NEH 11:28-30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 11:31" />Benjamin krungchakuüa dow Geba marow, Mikmas marow, Aija marow hai Bethel marow kowi krawi uowi khai, now Bethel marow aria aret kowi kowh kua ün kowi paw krawi uowi büah khai. <verse eid="NEH 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 11:32" />Nami klen kowi amatni dow Anathawt marow, Nawb marow, Anania marow, <verse eid="NEH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 11:33" />Hazawr marow, Rama marow, Gitaim marow, <verse eid="NEH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 11:34" />Hadid marow, Zeboim marow, Nebalat marow, <verse eid="NEH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 11:35" />Lawd marow, Ono marow hai Uanh Thawp Sarauüa Kowh Lawngrawi mowr krawi uowi büah khai. <verse eid="NEH 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 11:36" />Nami klen kowi auown khe kowh Juda süng kowi kowh uowi mih Leviuüa kowi dow Benjamin süng kowi aluchowuüa kowpe uowi büah khai.<verse eid="NEH 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NEH 12" />
  <para style="s">Uang plan mih uamowuüa hai Leviuüa ming</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 12:1" />Cham takhangra hownia Sealtiel chapa Zerubabel hai uamow lang kri mih Jesua iüah uang plan mih khin khe uamowuüa hai Leviuüa dow uang tawi plan sangrum khai. Uamowuüa pungmadawng hownia uang tawi plan miuüa dow Seraia, Jeremia, Ezra, <verse eid="NEH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 12:2" />Amaria, Maluk, Hatus, <verse eid="NEH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 12:3" />Sekania, Harim, Meremawt, <verse eid="NEH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 12:4" />Ido, Ginethawn, Abija, <verse eid="NEH 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 12:5" />Miniamin, Moadia, Bilga, <verse eid="NEH 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 12:6" />Semaia, Joiarib, Jedaia, <verse eid="NEH 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 12:7" />Salu, Amawk, Hilkia hai Jedaia büah chekhai. Jesua chowng khe amatni dow uamowuüa hai amatni kowh akhowng miuüa kowh lang kri mih chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 12:8" />Leviuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh uang tawi plan miuüa dow Jesua, Binui, Kadmiel, Serebia, Juda hai Matania büah chekhai. Thurai tut-e natek awmrawm meng kown mih kurdik uowi mih dow Matania hai aia krungchakuüa luk kowi chowtaih. <verse eid="NEH 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 12:9" />Tek meng mih khin khe amatni tatingtang klowk iowng mih dow amatni kowh akhowng mih Bakbukia hai Uni iüah chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 12:10" />Uamow Jesua kowh chapa dow Joiakim, Joiakim kowh chapa dow Eliasib, Eliasib kowh chapa dow Joiada, <verse eid="NEH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 12:11" />Joiada kowh chapa dow Johanan, now Johanan kowh chapa dow Jadua chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uamow krungchakuüa kowh aluchowuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 12:12" />Uamow lang kri mih Joiakim chowng khe kowh chowlowkkow uamow krungchakuüa kowi kowh aluchowuüa dow Seraia krungchak hownia Meraia, Jeremia krungchak hownia Hanani, <verse eid="NEH 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 12:13" />Ezra krungchak hownia Mesulam, Amaria krungchak hownia Jehohanan, <verse eid="NEH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 12:14" />Maluk krungchak hownia Jonathan, Sekania krungchak hownia Josef, <verse eid="NEH 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 12:15" />Harim krungchak hownia Adna, Meremawt krungchak hownia Helkai, <verse eid="NEH 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 12:16" />Ido krungchak hownia Zekaria, Ginethawn krungchak hownia Mesulam, <verse eid="NEH 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 12:17" />Abija krungchak hownia Zikri, Miniamin krungchak hownia paw aluchow uowi lowk ia, Moadia krungchak hownia Piltai, <verse eid="NEH 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 12:18" />Bilga krungchak hownia Samua, Semaia krungchak hownia Jehonathan, <verse eid="NEH 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 12:19" />Joiarib krungchak hownia Matenai, Edaia krungchak hownia Uzi, <verse eid="NEH 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 12:20" />Salu krungchak hownia Kalai, Amawk krungchak hownia Eber, <verse eid="NEH 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 12:21" />Hilkia krungchak hownia Hasabia, now Jedaia krungchak hownia Nethanel chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 12:22" />Leviuüa hai uamow krungchakuüa kowi kowh aluchowuüa ming tang bowih kowi tang pe ming mih dow uamow lang kri mih Eliasib, Joiada, Johanan hai Jadua büah chowng khe chekhai. Now Persia pren kowi Darius chowm mang khe paw naiawng amatni kowi mih ming tang bowih kowi tang pe ming khai. <verse eid="NEH 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 12:23" />Eliasib chapa Johanan chowng mowr mih Levi krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa ming dow Krungchakuüa Bowih kowi ruiah khai.<verse eid="NEH 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup chang miuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 12:24" />Levi krungchak kowi kowh aluchow mih Hasabia, Serebia, Jesua, Binui hai Kadmiel büah dow Leviuüa kowi athum athumchow changah khai. Naiawng changah mih thumchakuüa dow lowkkowlowk thum hown tatingtangah klowk now Thurai maru David tek iawng rowprowp iowng se Thurai kowi kiow hai tek awmrawm meng büah khai. <verse eid="NEH 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 12:25" />Nami khin khe kowh meng sara dow Matania, Bakbukia hai Obadia büah paw na chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 12:25">Mesulam, Talmawn hai Akub büah dow tapplawt re-e kowh dawngthawnguan towk rah kim chawng mih chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 12:26" />Kowbüah dow Jesua chapa Joiakim (Jesua kowh pa Jozadak), kruitown mih Nehemia, now uamow hai kawngmu sara Ezra büah chowng khe kowh kangchawng mih chekhai<verse eid="NEH 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai tut-e ap Jerusalem marow tap mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 12:27" />Thurai tut-e naap Jerusalem marow tap kown mih pawi khin khe dow lowra kowi cham uowi mih Leviuüa maten kowi Jerusalem marow kowi uang pe uangah khai. Naiawng Leviuüa uang mih dow nami pawi khe tepla klingchow, tingteng, taraw hai phek rut se awmrawm meng tek hanow napiaw kownkow chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 12:28" />Levi chenchap meng sarauüa uang mih dow Jerusalem marow riaret hownia, Netofa kua ün hownia, <verse eid="NEH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 12:29" />Bet-Gilgal marow hownia, Geba süng hai Azmavet süng hownia chekhai. Naiawngün meng sarauüa dow Jerusalem marow tapat lut kowi krawi thawp kua hanow uowi büah mih chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 12:30" />Uamowuüa hai Leviuüa dow auown kowi rik tachim tasai khai. Nami kung kowi dow maru kawmuüa kowi, tapplawt hai tap ün chimsaiah büah khai.<verse eid="NEH 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 12:31" />Nami kung kowi Judauüa kowh aluchowuüa kowi dow tap luk kowi ang Nehemia mih kowpawla khai, now nakowi natek awmrawm meng kownkow athum iukma mih meng sara pre thum ang towah khai. Pathum mih meng sara dow tap hownia iu dowm hanow tawngphak pra kowh Mawngchawng Tapplawt kowi kowkowi khai. <verse eid="NEH 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 12:32" />Nami thumchak kung tawi mih dow Hosaia hai Judauüa kowh aluchowuüa dawnglang chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 12:33" />Amatni hown kowh tawi miuüa dow Azaria, Ezra, Mesulam, <verse eid="NEH 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 12:34" />Juda, Benjamin, Semaia hai Jeremia büah chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 12:34" /><verse number="35-36" style="v" sid="NEH 12:35-36" />Nami klen kowi tum baw mih uamowuüa paw tawi ne chekhai. Naiawngün uamowuüa dow Zekaria hai Zekaria kowh tainau Semaia, Azarel, Milalai, Gilalai, Mai, Nethanel, Juda hai Hanani büah chekhai. Zekaria dow Jonathan kowh chapa, Jonathan dow Semaia kowh chapa, Semaia dow Matania kowh chapa, Matania dow Mikaia kowh chapa, Mikaia dow Zakur kowh chapa, now Zakur dow Asaf kowh chapa chekhai. Naiawngünuüa dow Thurai maru David khowm bowkla mih tünteu chang müa maten pawla now tawi khai. Naiawngün maru kawmuüa pur kowi rik mang mih dow kawngmu sara Ezra chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 12:35-36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 12:37" />Amatni dow Tuikuam Tapplawt re-e kowh uowi mih tap kowi kowh dawngbowk iawng David marow kowi awr pün khai, now David kowh kim ria iawng panow satlawt pra kowh Tui Tapplawt kowi kowkowi büah khai.<verse eid="NEH 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 12:38" />Now alowk mih meng sara thum paw tap luk iawng amatni hown tawi mang khai. Now ang paw maru dawnglang miuüa hown amatni kung kowi krawi ta mang khai. Amatni dow Sikua Kimkrowng klenla hanow Aphiama Mih Tap mowr kowkowi khai. <verse eid="NEH 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 12:39" />Nami hownia dow Efraim Tapplawt, Jesana Tapplawt, Dam Tapplawt, Hananel Kimkrowng hai Akawm Ia Kimkrowng iawng panow Ruapur Tapplawt mowr kowkowi büah khai. Nami hownia dow Kangchawngra Tapplawt kowi kowting hanow taingta büah khai.<verse eid="NEH 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 12:40" />Naiawng hai awmrawm meng tek mih pre thum dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowting khai bowt, now amatni kowh iowngra kowi kowiowng büah khai bowt. Ang paw ang tut-e kowh maru iukuüa dawnglang miuüa hown naiawng tawi chang khai. <verse eid="NEH 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 12:41" />Nakhowk khe ang hown kowh tawi uowi mih baw tum miuüa dow Eliakim, Maseia, Miniamin, Mikaia, Eliawenai, Zekaria hai Hanani büah chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 12:42" />Now meng sarauüa tawi uowi miuüa dow Maseia, Semaia, Eleazar, Jehohanan, Malkija, Elam hai Ezer büah chekhai. Naiawngün meng sarauüa dow Jezrahia krui mih iawng alowngma tek meng reng chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 12:43" />Thurai dow amatni kowi ahuma peah piawra khai. Naiawng rakowi maru kawmuüa dow nami ni khe aiukma mih phuchua pawi chang lowk khai, now nowm nowm piaw büah khai. Amatni kowh masi hai chauüa paw tawi piaw khai. Naiawng Jerusalem maru-uüa piaw mih klow dow alakma kowi pat cham ting khai.<verse eid="NEH 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim kowi uang pawla uanpek mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 12:44" />Nami ni khe dow aluchowuüa mih uanh towk rah kim kowi kowh uanpek, luprak müng hai hamüt bak kowi pabak mih tangka pawisa namü kownkow tow maru ne khai. Amatni dow kua riaret kowi kowh üa hai laih kowi krawi kowiah hanow maru-uüa hownia rirow kowi uowi iawng uamowuüa hai Leviuüa vüi krawi paw luprak khai. Nami khin khe Judauüa dow sak sowrma hown peah büah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow uamowuüa hai Leviuüa kowh lup kowi dow Juda pren kowi kowh maru maten sak-ih bowk chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 12:45" />Amatni dow David hai achapa Sawlawmawn ana pek iawng Thurai kowh lup hai maru kawmuüa kowh tachim tasai lup chang reng chekhai, now meng sarauüa hai kangchawng miuüa paw amatni kowi khowm bowk pe mih lup chang reng chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 12:46" />Achük alai khe mang David hai meng sara Asaf iüah chowng hownia Thurai kiow meng hai awmrawm meng tek mih meng sarauüa hai meng krui miuüa uowi reng chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 12:47" />Zerubabel hai Nehemia chowng khe paw meng sarauüa, kangchawng miuüa hai Leviuüa vüi ni towng kowh chakkham kakbak mih Israeluüa maten peah reng chekhai. Now naiawngün maru kawmuüa uang peah mih kakbak hownia Leviuüa dow Arawn krungchak uamowuüa vüi lang kra pe khai.<verse eid="NEH 12:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NEH 13" />
  <para style="s">Nehemia kowh achur lup</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 13:1" />Nami ni khe Mosi rirow bowih mih maru kawmuüa pur kowi phatah khai. Nakhowk khe nami bowih kowi maiawng arui uowi mih khi büah khai: Amawnuüa lah, Moabuüa lah amia iawng mih paw Thurai maru-uüa takua talawmra kowi natawi ia kowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="NEH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 13:2" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow Mosi chowng khe Israeluüa kowi chakkham hai tui kowpawla pe dowi chekhai. Naiawng nachang lak dow Thurai maru-uüa kowi peah piati kownkow Balam kowi ngaah büah khai. Nachenganchepaw anging kowh Thurai dow nami piati takcha kowi pe anging prasi khai. <verse eid="NEH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 13:3" />Maru kawmuüa dow nami ari aiang laiklow ta hanow Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh prenlang maru-uüa kowh krungchakuüa maten kowi lawtta bowk khai.<verse eid="NEH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="NEH 13:4-5" />Nami dowi rawn khe Thurai chup kim kowi kowh dawngthawnguan nungra mingkhet mih uamow Eleasib dow Tobia kowi towklak aiukma mih peah lowk khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Tobia dow Eliasib hown tasin taken mih maru chekhai. Nami towklak kowi dow nami dowi rawn khe kawmdi uanap, nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa hai Thurai chup kim kowi kowh uanh tow pe reng chekhai. Nami klen kowi nami towklak kowi mih Leviuüa, meng sarauüa hai kangchawng miuüa vüi kowi kowh maru uang pe mih luprak, grep tui sar, kanrawn sau hamüt bak kowi pabak mih hai uamowuüa kowi kowh maru uang peah mih paw tow pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 13:4-5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 13:6" />Naiawng phaw mih khin khe Jerusalem marow kowi ang uowi dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Babulawn pren mang Artazerzes chowm mang mih 32 ning khe mangkri tut-e ang kowplan khai. Akung kowi dow mangkri tut-e ang lüla ana hanow Jerusalem kowi ang uang plan khai. <verse eid="NEH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 13:7" />Now Jerusalem marow kowi ang uang ting kung kowi Thurai chup kim kowi kowh towklak Tobia kowi Eliasib peah lowk hanow chang lup ngak mih maten ang uang ta khai. <verse eid="NEH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 13:8" />Nami tata hanow lainowmma ang kunmarau khai. Naiawng rakowi nami towklak kowi kowh Tobia kowh uanh maten prang kowi ang kuakta pe bowk khai. <verse eid="NEH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 13:9" />Nami kung kowi dow ang ana pek iawng nami towklak mih chimsaiah khai. Now nami towklak kowi dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh uanh, kawmdi uanap uanh hai nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa uanh mih uang plan towah khai iawk.<verse eid="NEH 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 13:10" />Now meng sarauüa hai akeng mih Leviuüa kowi dow luprak uanap hownia kowh amatni kowh kakbak peah dowi rakowi amatni dow amatni kowh lup towla hanow amatni chowlowkkow krawng kowi plan büah khai pami paw ang uang ta khai. <verse eid="NEH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 13:11" />Naiawng rakowi nangah se maru iukuüa kowi ang tek pe mih, “Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup chang miuüa tawngplawng uowi dowi?” pakhai. Nami kung kowi dow chowlowkkow krawng bawn kowi plan mih Leviuüa maten kowi arasang ang kuaah khai, now amatni chowlowkkow arah kowi ang towah khai. <verse eid="NEH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 13:12" />Nahanow Juda maru-uüa maten dow luprak, grep tui sar hai kanrawn sau hamüt bak kowi pabak mih dawngthawnguan nungra kowi uang pawla büah khai. <verse eid="NEH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 13:13" />Now uamow Selemia, kawngmu sara Zadawk hai Levi chenchap Pedaia büah kowi dow dawngthawnguan nungra kim naming nakhet kownkow ang peah kurdik khai. Now amatni kowh akhowng mih dow Zakur kowh chapa Hanan kowi ang towah khai. Aia dow Matania kowh chu chekhai. Naiawngünuüa kowi dow bowkbowk maru kaah sakowm khai. Naiawngün maru-uüa kowi dow amatni kowh tainau-uüa kowi naret pe kakbak kown mih kurdik ang peah khai.<verse eid="NEH 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 13:14" />Now ang chup Thurai mih, “Aw ang kowh Thurai, en kowh kim hai nakowi kowh lup kaah sakowm iawng ang chang mih srui dow hangkow tamata diah. Naiawngün lup rakowi tuakla ang reng diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 13:15" />Nami khin khe Juda maru-uüa mih Tanai Ni kowi khe chang lup mih ang khi khai. Amatni dow küa grep uih khai, now uang pawla luprak hanow nami luprak, grep tui, grep uih, uidut uih hai kurdik maiow kawrngaramchük luk kowi tang pe khai. Nami klen kowi amatni dow naiawngün mih Tanai Ni khe Jerusalem marow kowi uang pawla büah khai. Naiawng rakowi Tanai Ni kowi kowh chakkham nasum kown mih lawnguan kowi nauowi kaneu kown mih amatni kowi ang tek pe khai. <verse eid="NEH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 13:16" />Jerusalem marow kowi uowi mih Sur maru-uüa dow Tanai Ni khe dam hai sumah kown mih akeng mih uanh maten krawi sum khai. Amatni dow naiawngün uanh mih Jerusalem marow kowi khowm padow Juda maru-uüa tut-e sum büah khai. <verse eid="NEH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 13:17" />Nakhowk khe Juda maru iukuüa kowi nangah se ang tek pe mih, “Tawng chow naiawng enni chang? Naiawng mih lup ngak enni chang mih dow Tanai Ni chimsaima mih enni piakah mih chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 13:18" />Enni kowh pipu-uüa paw Tanai Ni kowi piakah nadowi bow? Maiawng mih angak rakowi a-i luk kowi hai mami marow luk kowi a-i kowh Thurai uang pawla phih mih chekhai. Kawmat paw chimsaima mih Tanai Ni enni piakta khai iawk. Israeluüa luk kowi Thurai kowh kunmaraura enni pe huah ngamlam khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 13:19" />Tanai Ni uown dowi rawn sat kup khowk now Jerusalem marow tapplawt ün nabüngta kown mih ana ang peta khowk. Now naiawngün tapplawt dow Tanai Ni chur dowi mowr nahing büngta hüah kown. Tanai Ni khe lowra mih kurdik alak kowi nauang ia pawla dowi kownkow ang matia kowh maru iuk kowi dow tapplawt ün kowi ang krawi towah khowk. <verse eid="NEH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 13:20" />Naiawng rakowi kun chang miuüa hai achap akawm uanh sum miuüa dow Jerusalem marow uat kowi iak pre sum kat khowk chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 13:21" />Kaneuma nauowi kownkow amatni kowi ang tek pe mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow tap re-e enni kowtuk iak khai? Enni che naiawng plan chang khai iawk hanow ang narip enni kown,” pakhai. Nami hownia now amatni dow Tanai Ni khe uang tarü dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 13:22" />Nami kung kowi dow amatni tachim tasaila kownkow hai Tanai Ni chimsaima natowah kownkow nachawng tapplawt ün kown mih Leviuüa kowi ang peah ana khai.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 13:22" />
  <para style="pi" vid="NEH 13:22">Now ang chup Thurai mih, “Aw ang kowh Thurai, ang kowh kaah sakowmma mih lup tuakla ang reng diah, now en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura ahuma tüng ang diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 13:23" />Nami khin khe Asdawd chenchap masiuüa, Amawn chenchap masiuüa hai Moab chenchap masiuüa kowi Judauüa chawngah mih paw ang khi khai. <verse eid="NEH 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 13:24" />Amatni kowh chauüa dawnglang mih dow akeng mih chenchap lai tawi tek khai. Amatni dow Judauüa lai tuk tek dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="NEH 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 13:25" />Amatni kowi dow ang nangah khai, now ang peah piati khai. Amatni pungmadawng kowi maru sangrum kowi dow ang bawpah khai, now ang chawi pe sam khai. Amatni kowi dow amatni kowh chapa chamauüa kowi prenlang maru-uüa hown nape tachawngah dowi kownkow Thurai ming hown ang pe takhamah khai. <verse eid="NEH 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 13:26" />Now ang tek pe amatni mih, “Israel mang Sawlawmawn paw naiawng akeng chenchap masiuüa kowi paw rakowi chang lup ngak nadowi bow? Akeng chenchapuüa tut-e aia iawng mih mang miapaw uowi dowi bowt chekhai, now Thurai dow aia kowi sakrauah chekhai. Aia kowi dow Israeluüa maten luk kowi pe chowmah mang khai. Nachenganchepaw aia kowi dow aia kowh prenlang masiuüa mih angak prakowi pawla khai. <verse eid="NEH 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 13:27" />Tawngplawng kowchow enni paw naiawng mih lup ngak enni tuk chang khai? Tawngplawng kowchow prenlang masiuüa kowi enni chawng hanow CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai kaah sakowm dowi mih lup enni tuk chang khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 13:28" />Joiada kowh chapa lowk ia mih dow Horon chenchap Sanbalat kowh chama kowi chawngah khai. Naiawng rakowi Joiada kowi dow ang hownia ang prütta khai. Joiada dow Uamow lang kri mih Eliasib kowh chapa chekhai.<verse eid="NEH 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 13:29" />Now ang chup Thurai mih, “Aw ang kowh Thurai, amatni kowh laiklow dow tuakah reng diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow uamow rah mih sürlawkah büah khai. Now amatni dow uamowuüa hai Leviuüa kowh lup chang laikham piakta büah khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 13:30" />Naiawng hai prenlang maru-uüa hownia uamowuüa hai Leviuüa kowi dow chimsaima ang towah khai. Now amatni kowi dow amatni chowlowkkow kowh lup ang tüngsangah khai. <verse eid="NEH 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 13:31" />Nami klen kowi singh hai rik kaah mih luprak paw akhin khe nauang pawla kownkow ang tek pe napnap khai.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 13:31" />
  <para style="pi" vid="NEH 13:31">Now ang chup Thurai iawk mih, “Aw ang kowh Thurai, ang naiungla kownkow tuakla ang reng diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="NEH 13:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 13" />
</usx>